== 早年经历 ==
1970年7月30日，克里斯多福·爱德华·诺兰在伦敦[[西敏]]出生。父亲布兰登（Brendan）是爱尔兰裔的英国广告主管，曾担任[[创意总监]]<ref>{{cite web|title=Christopher Nolan, although a native of London, proudly traces his lineage back to Irish roots' |url=https://www.irishhistory.com/genealogy/irish-surnames/nolan-family-name-history/|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20240312001606/https://www.irishhistory.com/genealogy/irish-surnames/nolan-family-name-history/ |archivedate=2024-03-12 }}</ref>；母亲克里斯蒂娜（Christina）曾是来自[[伊利诺伊州]][[埃文斯顿 (伊利诺伊州)|埃文斯顿]]的美国[[空姐]]，后来做英语[[老师]]。他有个哥哥马修（Matthew），而弟弟[[乔纳森·诺兰|乔纳森]]也是电影制作人。三人在[[海格特 (北伦敦)|海格特]]长大，均为[[天主教会|天主教徒]]，夏天会在埃文斯顿度过<ref>{{Cite web |last=Grimes |first=Christopher |date=2023-07-21 |title=Director Christopher Nolan: 'Oppenheimer is absolutely a cautionary tale' |url=https://www.ft.com/content/e47df8a6-21fa-4d8c-9817-351f1a438aef |url-access=subscription |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20230918224920/https://www.ft.com/content/e47df8a6-21fa-4d8c-9817-351f1a438aef |archive-date=2023-09-18 |access-date=2024-01-31 |website=Financial Times |issn=0307-1766}}</ref><ref>{{Cite AV media |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PqGrR2Upz0M |title=Writers Bloc Presents: Christopher Nolan, Tom Shone and Kenneth Branagh |date=2020-12-02 |publisher=Writers Bloc Presents |time=56:02 |access-date=2023-02-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230209153617/https://www.youtube.com/watch?app=desktop&v=PqGrR2Upz0M |archive-date=2023-02-09 |url-status=live}}</ref>。诺兰年幼时也曾在[[芝加哥]]待过，并同时拥有英美双国籍<ref>{{cite news |last1=Gomez |first1=Luis |title=Batman's Chicago connection |url=https://www.chicagotribune.com/2014/07/22/batmans-chicago-connection/ |work=Chicago Tribune |date=2014-07-22 |access-date=2024-08-26 |archive-date=2024-03-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240317021942/https://www.chicagotribune.com/2014/07/22/batmans-chicago-connection/ |url-status=live }}</ref>{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=12-13}}。

[[File:Flaxman Gallery, UCL.JPG|thumb|right|upright=1.0|诺兰曾就读[[伦敦大学学院]]，当中的弗拉克斯曼展览馆在《[[全面启动]]》（2010年）有取景<ref>{{Cite news |date=2010-07-14 |title=Nolan's Mind Games |publisher=Film London |url=http://filmlondon.org.uk/news/2010/july/nolans_mind_games |url-status=dead |access-date=2010-08-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20101122213601/http://filmlondon.org.uk/news/2010/july/nolans_mind_games |archive-date=2010-11-22}}</ref>|alt=An image showing the top of the oculus in the Flaxman Gallery, University College London]]
在成长过程中，诺兰尤其受到[[雷利·史考特]]的作品、科幻电影《[[2001太空漫游 (电影)|2001太空漫游]]》（1968年）和《[[星际大战四部曲：曙光乍现|星球大战]]》（1977年）的影响{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=4}}{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=116,159}}，他会反复观看后者并大面积研究其制作{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=159}}。诺兰从7岁就开始拍电影，像是借用父亲的[[超8毫米底片|超8摄像机]]来拍自己可动人偶的短片{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=11,16}}，包括向《星球大战》致敬的[[定格动画]]片《太空大战》（''Space Wars''），弟弟乔纳森参演之余，还用「黏土、面粉、鸡蛋盒和卷筒卫生纸」制作布景{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=4}}。诺兰的叔叔曾在[[NASA]]为[[阿波罗计划|阿波罗]]火箭建造制导系统，所以给了些发射镜头，他后来谈及：「我把它们从屏幕上重新拍摄下来，接著切入，认为没人会注意到」<ref>{{cite news |last1=Purcell |first1=Andrew |title=Christopher Nolan's Interstellar brings back the Spielberg-style family blockbuster |url=https://www.smh.com.au/entertainment/movies/christopher-nolans-interstellar-brings-back-the-spielbergstyle-family-blockbuster-20141104-11gjqp.html |access-date=2022-12-09 |work=The Sydney Morning Herald |date=2014-11-04 |archive-date=2022-12-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221209185721/https://www.smh.com.au/entertainment/movies/christopher-nolans-interstellar-brings-back-the-spielbergstyle-family-blockbuster-20141104-11gjqp.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。他11岁时就立志成为专业电影制作人<ref name="telegraph">{{Cite news |last=Lawrence|first=Will |date=2012-07-19 |title=Christopher Nolan interview for ''Inception'' |work=The Daily Telegraph |url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/film/filmmakersonfilm/7894376/Christopher-Nolan-interview-for-Inception.html |url-status=live |access-date=2014-01-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131117141943/http://www.telegraph.co.uk/culture/film/filmmakersonfilm/7894376/Christopher-Nolan-interview-for-Inception.html |archive-date=2013-11-17|url-access=subscription}}</ref>。1981至1983年，诺兰就读[[萨里郡]][[韦布里奇]]的天主教巴罗山预科学校{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=26}}。诺兰青少年时开始与阿德里安（Adrien）和{{tsl|en|Roko Belic|罗科·贝利克}}一起拍电影，他和罗科共同执导的[[超现实主义|超现实]][[超8毫米胶片|8毫米胶片]]电影《塔朗特舞》（''Tarantella''，1989年）在[[公共广播电视公司]]的独立电影和影片展示剧《影像联盟》（''Image Union''）放映{{efn|诺兰与贝利克兄弟持续合作，并在他们的奥斯卡提名传记片《{{tsl|en|Genghis Blues|成吉思汗蓝调}}》（1999年）冠上协助编辑的头衔{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=156}}。}}{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=5}}{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=48}}。2021年，有粉丝把《塔朗特舞》上传到网上，遭到诺兰的制作公司提出侵权索赔，并要求删除影片<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kuo |first=Christopher |date=2024-03-07 |title=The Film Christopher Nolan Doesn't Want You to Watch |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/07/movies/christopher-nolan-larceny.html |access-date=2024-03-07 |website=New York Times |archive-date=2024-03-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240307192552/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/07/movies/christopher-nolan-larceny.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

诺兰在[[赫特福德郡|赫特福德郡]]{{tsl|en|Hertford Heath|赫特福特希斯}}的私立学校{{tsl|en|Haileybury and Imperial Service College|黑利伯瑞和帝国服务学院}}接受教育，后来在[[伦敦大学学院]]学习[[英语文学]]。他之所以不读传统的电影教育，而是「与此无关的学位」，是因为父亲觉得这样「会对事物有不同看法」{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=6}}。而他选择伦敦大学学院是为了电影制作设备，包括{{tsl|en|Steenbeck|Steenbeck|Steenbeck剪辑套装}}和{{tsl|en|16 mm film|16毫米胶片|16毫米胶片摄像机}}<ref name="Tempest">{{cite news|last=Tempest|first= Matthew |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/filmblog/2011/feb/24/inception-christopher-nolan-film-oscar-director |title=I was there at the ''Inception'' of Christopher Nolan's film career|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131005100119/http://www.theguardian.com/film/filmblog/2011/feb/24/inception-christopher-nolan-film-oscar-director |archive-date=5 October 2013|work=[[卫报|The Guardian]]|date=2011-02-24|access-date=2011-09-21}}</ref>。诺兰是联盟电影协会的主席<ref name="Tempest" />，他会在学年期间与[[艾玛·托马斯]]（女友和未来妻子）一起放映[[35毫米胶片]]的[[剧情长片]]，并用赚来的钱在暑假制作16毫米胶片电影<ref name="British Cinematographer pt2">{{Cite web |year=2010 |title=Wally Pfister ASC on Christopher Nolan's ''Inception'' |url=http://www.thecinematographer.info/articles/18-wally-pfister.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120411005825/http://www.thecinematographer.info/articles/18-wally-pfister.html |archive-date=2012-04-11 |access-date=2013-02-12 |publisher=American Society of Cinematographers}}</ref>。

== 事业 ==
=== 起步和突破（1993至2003年） ===
诺兰于1993年拿到英语文学学士学位后，曾做过{{tsl|en|Script analyst|剧本分析师|剧本读评人}}、{{tsl|en|camera operator|摄影机操作员}}、{{tsl|en|corporate video|企业影片}}和{{tsl|en|Sponsored film|业配电影|工业电影}}的导演<ref name="Tempest" /><ref name="Feinberg">{{Cite magazine |last=Feinberg, Scott |date=2015-01-03 |title=Christopher Nolan on ''Interstellar'' Critics, Making Original Films and Shunning Cell Phones and Email (Q&A) |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/race/christopher-nolan-interstellar-critics-making-760897 |url-status=live |work=The Hollywood Reporter |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180117111636/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/race/christopher-nolan-interstellar-critics-making-760897 |archive-date=2018-01-17 |access-date=2017-02-01}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=''Fearville'' (1997) |url=http://www.bfi.org.uk/films-tv-people/4ce2b81581f07 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171107104214/http://www.bfi.org.uk/films-tv-people/4ce2b81581f07 |archive-date=2017-11-07 |access-date=2017-02-01 |publisher=British Film Institute}}</ref>。他执导、编剧和剪辑《盗窃》（''Larceny''，1996年）{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=34}}，其是在一个周末以有限的设备和小型剧组拍摄的黑白短片{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=5}}<ref>{{Cite news |title=Christopher Nolan: The Movies. The Memories |url=https://www.empireonline.com/interviews/interview.asp?IID=1052 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150924064331/http://www.empireonline.com/interviews/interview.asp?IID=1052 |archive-date=2015-09-24 |access-date=2013-02-12 |work=Empire|issue=253}}</ref>。影片由诺兰出资，使用{{tsl|en|Students' Union UCL|伦敦大学学院学生会|伦敦大学学院联盟}}电影协会的器材拍摄，在1996年{{tsl|en|Cambridge Film Festival|剑桥影展}}放映，并被认为是伦敦大学学院的最佳短片<ref>{{Cite web |title=UCLU Film Society, London |url=http://www.ucl.ac.uk/~uczxflm/productions/archive/9495 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120810232748/http://www.ucl.ac.uk/~uczxflm/productions/archive/9495/ |archive-date=2012-08-10 |access-date=2013-02-12 |publisher=University College London}}</ref>，但因不明原因，其消失在公众视野{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=34}}。诺兰拍摄第三部短片《{{tsl|en|Doodlebug (film)|狮蚁 (电影)|蚁蛉}}》（1997年），讲述一个男人看似用鞋子追打昆虫，实则是缩小的自己{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=6}}<ref name="independent">{{Cite news |last=Hooton |first=Christopher |date=2017-04-10 |title=Christopher Nolan's student short film ''Doodlebug'' shows the ''Dunkirk'' director's humble beginnings |url=https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/films/news/christopher-nolan-director-dunkirk-short-first-film-doodlebug-student-ucl-london-a7675861.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190722194629/https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/films/news/christopher-nolan-director-dunkirk-short-first-film-doodlebug-student-ucl-london-a7675861.html |archive-date=2019-07-22 |access-date=2019-07-22 |work=The Independent|url-access=registration}}</ref>。

诺兰和托马斯在1990年代首次尝试制作长片《拉里·马奥尼》（''Larry Mahoney''），但最终放弃<ref>{{cite news |last1=Whitington |first1=Paul |title=How Christopher Nolan has held true to his sweeping vision with ''Tenet'' |url=https://www.independent.ie/entertainment/movies/how-christopher-nolan-has-held-true-to-his-sweeping-vision-with-tenet-39466428.html |access-date=2022-12-10 |work=Irish Independent |date=2020-08-22 |url-access=subscription |archive-date=2022-12-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221210113740/https://www.independent.ie/entertainment/movies/how-christopher-nolan-has-held-true-to-his-sweeping-vision-with-tenet-39466428.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。诺兰这段时间几乎没有成功落实项目，多次遭到拒绝，他补充说：「英国的资金池非常有限。老实说，这是个非常排外的地方……（我）从来没有得过英国影业的任何资助」<ref name="AndrewPulver05">{{Cite news |last=Pulver |first=Andrew |date=2005-06-15 |title=He's not a god – he's human |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2005/jun/15/features.features11 |url-status=live |access-date=2013-12-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131224110327/http://www.theguardian.com/film/2005/jun/15/features.features11 |archive-date=2013-12-24}}</ref>。

诺兰放弃《拉里·马奥尼》不久后开始构思长片处女作《[[追随|追随]]》（1998年），负责编剧、执导、拍摄和剪辑，并讲述失业的年轻作家（{{tsl|en|Jeremy Theobald|杰里米·西奥伯德|杰瑞米·西奥伯德}}饰）在伦敦跟踪陌生人来为首部小说寻找素材，但由于未能保持距离而卷入充满罪犯的地下社会。影片启发自诺兰居住在伦敦的公寓被盗，他观察到盗窃和在人群中追捕某人的共同特质都是跨越了社会界限{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=20-21}}。《追随》由诺兰、托马斯和西奥伯德制片{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=441}}，预算大约3000英镑，剧组大多数成员都是导演的朋友，并在一年中数个周末进行拍摄{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=24;42}}。为了节省{{tsl|en|film stock|电影胶卷}}，每一幕都经过大量的排练，来确保第一或第二颗镜头能用作最后剪辑，此外该电影还大量使用[[现有光源]]进行拍摄{{sfn|Mooney|2018|p=6}}<ref name="Tobias">{{cite news|author=Tobias, Scott|url= https://www.avclub.com/christopher-nolan-1798208223|title= Interview: Christopher Nolan|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131018024630/http://www.avclub.com/articles/christopher-nolan,13769/ |archive-date=2013-10-18 |work=The A.V. Club|date=2002-06-05|access-date=2022-12-10}}</ref>。《追随》在影展上映期间赢得多个奖项，并取得评论界称赞，认为诺兰是才华横溢的新人<ref>{{Cite web |title=Tiger Awards Competition: previous winners |url=http://www.filmfestivalrotterdam.com/en/about/awards-and-jury/tiger-awards/previous-winners |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130121013119/http://www.filmfestivalrotterdam.com/en/about/awards-and-jury/tiger-awards/previous-winners/ |archive-date=2013-01-21 |access-date=2013-02-12 |publisher=International Film Festival Rotterdam}}</ref>{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=30-31}}。《{{tsl|en|New Times LA|洛杉矶新时报}}》的{{tsl|en|Scott Timberg|斯科特·廷伯格}}认为电影「模仿了[[亚弗列·希治阁|希区考克]]的经典作品」，但「更短小精悍」<ref name="Timberg">{{Cite news |last=Timberg |first=Scott |date=2001-03-15 |title=Indie Angst |url=http://cinefiles.bampfa.berkeley.edu/cinefiles/DocDetail?docId=49987 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170815135228/https://cinefiles.bampfa.berkeley.edu/cinefiles/DocDetail?docId=49987 |archive-date=2017-08-15 |access-date=2013-06-04 |work=New Times LA|via=CineFiles}}</ref>。《[[纽约时报]]》的{{tsl|en|Janet Maslin|珍妮特·马斯林}}对其「简朴的外观」和「敏锐的手持摄影技巧」感到印象深刻，并表示「因此演员由始至终都成功（保持）令人信服的状态，让电影最终巧妙地编织在一起」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Maslin |first=Janet |title=Film Festival Review: Walking Along a Crooked Path |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |url=https://www.nytimes.com/movie/review?res=9C0CE1D71439F931A35757C0A96F958260 |url-status=dead |access-date=2017-02-03 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170204011800/http://www.nytimes.com/movie/review?res=9C0CE1D71439F931A35757C0A96F958260 |archive-date=2017-02-04|url-access=limited|date=1999-04-02}}</ref>。

{{Quote box|width=25%|align=left|quote=「拍摄《[[追随|追随]]》是一群朋友穿著自己的衣服，我妈会做些三文治，而《[[凶心人]]》是拿著别人的400万美金和拥有百人剧组，两者的不同是直到今天都是我最大的跨越。」|source=——诺兰于2012年谈及从首部电影跳到第二部<ref>{{cite news |last1=Macdonald |first1=Moira |title=An interview with Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.seattletimes.com/entertainment/movies/an-interview-with-christopher-nolan/ |access-date=2022-12-01 |work=The Seattle Times |date=2012-07-17 |archive-date=2022-12-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221201164842/https://www.seattletimes.com/entertainment/movies/an-interview-with-christopher-nolan/ |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

随著《追随》的成功，诺兰有机会制作《[[凶心人]]》（2000年），这也成为他的突破性电影。弟弟乔纳森向他提出了个想法：患有[[顺行性遗忘症|顺行性遗忘症]]的男人利用笔记和纹身来找出杀害妻子的凶手。乔纳森将这个点子写成短篇小说《{{tsl|en|Memento Mori (short story)|死亡象征 (小说)|死亡象征}}》（2001年），诺兰改编剧本时把故事反过来，{{tsl|en|Newmarket Films|新市场影业}}的行政主管亚伦·瑞德（Aaron Ryder）称这「可能是我见过最新颖的剧本」{{sfn|Mottram|2002|p=176}}。影片最后被选中并获得450万美金的预算，由[[盖·皮尔斯|盖·皮尔斯]]和[[凯莉-安·摩丝|凯莉-安·摩丝]]主演{{sfn|Mottram|2002|p=177}}。由于大厂担心电影不会吸引过多的观众而拒绝发行，所以新市场也负责这个职务，在500家影院放映[[口耳相传|打好口碑]]后，入帐4000万美元{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=45-48}}。《凶心人》于2000年9月在[[威尼斯电影节]]举行首映，并取得好评{{sfn|Mottram|2002|pp=62-64}}。《[[华尔街日报]]》的{{tsl|en|Joe Morgenstern|乔·摩根斯坦}}在评论时写道「我不记得什么时候有部电影会同时看起来如此聪明、出乎意料的动人和狡猾有趣」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Morgenstern |first=Joe |title=Hero With No Memory Turns ''Memento'' Into Unforgettable Trip |work=[[华尔街日报|The Wall Street Journal]] |url=https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB9846986937127287|date=2001-03-16 |url-status=live |access-date=2014-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150326002730/http://www.wsj.com/articles/SB9846986937127287 |archive-date=2015-03-26|url-access=subscription}}</ref>。贝斯尔·史密斯（Basil Smith）在《新黑色的哲学》（''The Philosophy of Neo-Noir''）拿[[约翰·洛克]]的《[[人类理解论]]》作出比较，称此书和诺兰在电影中都有探讨意识记忆构成我们的身份这个主题{{sfn|Smith|2007|p=35}}。《凶心人》为诺兰获得许多荣誉，包括入围[[奥斯卡最佳原创剧本奖|奥斯卡金像奖]]和[[金球奖最佳剧本]]，及[[独立精神奖]]的[[独立精神奖最佳导演奖|最佳导演]]和{{tsl|en|Independent Spirit Award for Best Screenplay|独立精神奖最佳剧本|最佳剧本}}<ref name="nytimesawards">{{Cite news |date=2013 |title=Christopher Nolan awards |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |url=https://www.nytimes.com/movies/person/240025/Christopher-Nolan/awards |url-status=dead |access-date=2014-03-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131024065520/http://www.nytimes.com/movies/person/240025/Christopher-Nolan/awards |archive-date=2013-10-24|url-access=limited}}</ref>{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=19}}。六个影评人将其列入{{tsl|en|2000s in film|2000年电影|2000年最佳电影}}<ref name="Metadecade">{{Cite web |last=Dietz|first=Jason|date=2010-01-03 |title=Film Critics Pick the Best Movies of the Decade |url=https://www.metacritic.com/feature/film-critics-pick-the-best-movies-of-the-decade |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170428073436/http://www.metacritic.com/feature/film-critics-pick-the-best-movies-of-the-decade |archive-date=2017-04-28 |access-date=2012-09-04 |publisher=[[Metacritic]]}}</ref>。2001年，诺兰和艾玛·汤玛斯创立{{tsl|en|Syncopy Inc.|切分音公司|切分音}}制片公司<ref name="syncopy"/>{{efn|公司名称来自晕倒的[[晕厥|医学名称]]。专攻电影研究的讲师索查·妮弗兰（Sorcha Ní Fhlainn）称这个词影射了诺兰作品有著「迷失方向」的风格，还将这个名字与综合哲学家[[尚·布希亚|让·鲍德里亚]]的{{tsl|en|treatise|专著}}《[[拟像论|拟仿物与拟像]]》联系起来{{sfn|Ní Fhlainn|2015|p=161}}。}}。

电影制作人[[史蒂文·索德伯格|史蒂芬·索德柏]]对诺兰在《凶心人》的表现留下好印象，所以将他推荐给[[华纳兄弟]]来执导[[心理惊悚|心理惊悚片]]《[[白夜追凶]]》（2002年），尽管大厂最初想要经验更丰富的导演{{sfn|deWaard|Tait|2013|p=49}}。影片翻拍自1997年{{tsl|en|Insomnia (1997 film)|极度失眠|同名挪威惊悚片}}，并被视为「诺兰电影作品的异类」，原因是其缺乏他众所周知的非常规风格{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=50}}。《白夜追凶》由[[艾尔·帕西诺|阿尔·帕西诺]]、[[罗宾·威廉斯|罗宾·威廉姆斯]]和[[希拉里·斯旺克]]主演{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=442}}，讲述两名洛杉矶警探派往阿拉斯加州北部小镇去调查当地少年谋杀案，而在上映后叫好叫座，以4600万美金的预算赚入1亿1300万美金的票房<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Insomnia'' |url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1114154-insomnia/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100802163407/http://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1114154-insomnia/ |archive-date=2010-08-02 |access-date=2014-01-18 |publisher=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=''Insomnia'' |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=insomnia.htm |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100808004401/http://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=insomnia.htm |archive-date=2010-08-08 |access-date=2014-01-18 |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]]}}</ref>。影评人[[罗杰·埃伯特]]称赞这部电影在道德和罪责问题上引入新的观点和想法，并补充道：「与大多数翻拍电影不同，诺兰的《白夜追凶》不是苍白的翻新，而是重新审视素材，就像全新制作一出好戏」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Ebert |first=Roger |date=2002-05-24 |title=''Insomnia'' review |url=https://www.rogerebert.com/reviews/insomnia-2002 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150213010524/http://www.rogerebert.com/reviews/insomnia-2002 |archive-date=2015-02-13 |access-date=2015-02-18 |work=RogerEbert.com|author-link=罗杰·埃伯特}}</ref>。《[[时代杂志|时代]]》的{{tsl|en|Richard Schickel|理查德·什克尔}}觉得《白夜追凶》是《凶心人》「当之无愧的接替者」，并且是「氛围大胜不太神秘的谜团」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Schickel |first=Richard|date=2002-05-19 |title=Sleepless in Alaska |url=http://content.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,238623,00.html |url-status=live |work=[[时代杂志|Time]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150113065714/http://content.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,238623,00.html |archive-date=2015-01-13 |access-date=2015-02-16}}</ref>。

《追随》、《凶心人》和《白夜追凶》确立了诺兰「[[作者论|电影作者]]」的形象{{sfn|Hill-Parks|2015|p=26}}。诺兰拍完《白夜追凶》就为[[霍华德·休斯|霍华德·休斯]]传记片创作剧本，但得知[[马丁·斯科塞斯]]已经拍出类似的电影《[[飞行者|飞行家]]》（2004年）后不情愿地搁置这个项目{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=64-65}}。随后，他曾短暂获[[探照灯影业|福克斯探照灯影业]]邀请执导改编自[[露丝·伦德尔]]小说《{{tsl|en|The Keys to the Street|通往街道的钥匙}}》的电影，但最后选择《[[蝙蝠侠：开战时刻]]》（2005年）<ref name=chapman>{{cite web|last=Chapman|first=Wilson|title=Christopher Nolan's Unmade Films: Movies the ''Oppenheimer'' Director Almost Made|date=2023-07-20|website=IndieWire|url=https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/christopher-nolan-unmade-films/|accessdate=2023-08-11|archive-date=2023-08-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230826135828/https://www.indiewire.com/gallery/christopher-nolan-unmade-films/|url-status=live}}</ref>，同时拒绝执导历史史诗片《[[特洛伊：木马屠城|特洛伊：木马屠城]]》（2004年）<ref>{{Cite news |last=Jagernauth |first=Kevin |title=Trivia: When Christopher Nolan First Came to Warner Bros., He Was Offered ''Troy'' to Direct |publisher=IndieWire |date=2013-06-21|url=http://blogs.indiewire.com/theplaylist/trivia-when-christopher-nolan-first-came-to-warner-bros-he-was-offered-troy-to-direct-20130621 |url-status=dead |access-date=2014-08-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140813021758/http://blogs.indiewire.com/theplaylist/trivia-when-christopher-nolan-first-came-to-warner-bros-he-was-offered-troy-to-direct-20130621 |archive-date=2014-08-13}}</ref>。2003年4月，电影制作人[[大卫·欧·拉塞尔|戴维·O·拉塞尔]]得知原本加入的演员[[裘德·洛|裘德·洛]]转而跟诺兰合作，在好莱坞派对挟著他的头，并施压一定要让洛退出来体现「艺术上的团结」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Waxman |first=Sharon |author-link=Sharon Waxman |date=2004-09-19 |title=The Nudist Buddhist Borderline-Abusive Love-In |work=The New York Times |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2004/09/19/movies/the-nudist-buddhist-borderlineabusive-lovein.html |access-date=2022-12-27 |url-access=limited |archive-date=2022-10-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221014203253/https://www.nytimes.com/2004/09/19/movies/the-nudist-buddhist-borderlineabusive-lovein.html |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="vulture">{{Cite news |last=Zhan |first=Jennifer |date=2022-10-05 |title=A Timeline of the Allegations Against Amsterdam Director David O. Russell |url=https://www.vulture.com/2022/10/david-o-russell-abuse-assault-allegations-timeline.html |access-date=2022-12-27 |work=Vulture |archive-date=2022-12-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221226011317/https://www.vulture.com/2022/10/david-o-russell-abuse-assault-allegations-timeline.html |url-status=live }}</ref>。

=== 取得广泛认可（2003至2013年） ===
2003年初，诺兰接洽华纳兄弟，提出要根据[[蝙蝠侠]]的起源故事来制作新电影的想法<ref name="bb-latimes">{{Cite news |last=Greenberg |first=James |date=2005-05-08 |title=Rescuing Batman |url=https://www.latimes.com/archives/la-xpm-2005-may-08-ca-batman8-story.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191217132113/https://www.latimes.com/archives/la-xpm-2005-may-08-ca-batman8-story.html |archive-date=2019-12-17 |access-date=2019-12-17 |work=[[洛杉矶时报|Los Angeles Times]]}}</ref>。诺兰著迷于呈现出比漫画书中的奇幻故事更真实的世界{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=73-75}}，所以在拍摄过程中极为依赖传统[[电影特技|特技]]和{{tsl|en|miniature effect|微缩模型效果}}，鲜少使用[[电脑合成影像]]{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=69}}。《[[蝙蝠侠：开战时刻]]》是诺兰当时参与过的最大项目<ref>{{Cite news|last=Foundas |first=Scott |title=Christopher Nolan looks back over the ''Dark Knight'' trilogy in this extended interview |url=http://filmcomment.com/article/cinematic-faith-christopher-nolan-scott-foundas |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170820002832/https://www.filmcomment.com/article/cinematic-faith-christopher-nolan-scott-foundas/ |archive-date=2017-08-20 |access-date=2013-06-27 |work=Film Comment}}</ref>，一经上映后无论商业还是评论都大获成功<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Batman Begins''|url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/batman_begins/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180115152611/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/batman_begins/ |archive-date=2018-01-15 |access-date=2014-01-18 |publisher=[[烂番茄|Rotten Tomatoes]]}}</ref><ref name=":0" />。[[克里斯汀·贝尔]]主演[[布鲁斯·韦恩 (黑暗骑士三部曲)|布鲁斯·韦恩/蝙蝠侠]]，再加上其他演员[[米高·肯恩|麦克·肯恩]]、[[加里·奥德曼|加里·奥德曼]]、[[摩根·弗里曼]]和[[连恩·尼逊|连姆·尼森]]，《蝙蝠侠：开战时刻》重新开启系列电影<ref>{{Cite news |last=Sims|first=David|title=The Complicated Legacy of ''Batman Begins'' |url=https://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2015/06/the-complicated-legacy-of-batman-begins/395477/|date=2015-06-10 |url-status=live |work=The Atlantic |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150611041139/http://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2015/06/the-complicated-legacy-of-batman-begins/395477/ |archive-date=2015-06-11 |access-date=2015-06-10|url-access=subscription}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |first=Shawn|last= Adler |date=2008-08-14 |title=He-Man' Movie Will Go Realistic: 'We're Not Talking About Putting Nipples on the Trapjaw Suit |url=http://moviesblog.mtv.com/2008/08/14/he-man-movie-will-go-realistic-were-not-talking-about-putting-nipples-on-the-trapjaw-suit |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20080902155525/http://moviesblog.mtv.com/2008/08/14/he-man-movie-will-go-realistic-were-not-talking-about-putting-nipples-on-the-trapjaw-suit |archive-date=2008-09-02 |access-date=2013-04-08|publisher=[[MTV]]}}</ref>。《蝙蝠侠：开战时刻》是2005年票房第九高的电影，其心理深度和当代意义受到赞誉<ref name=":0">{{cite web |title=2005 Worldwide Box Office |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/year/world/2005/?ref_=bo_cso_table_1 |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]] |access-date=2022-12-13 |archive-date=2019-07-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190707054520/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/yearly/chart/?view2=worldwide&yr=2005&p=.htm |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Christopher Nolan Season at BFI Southbank in July 2012 |url=http://www.bfi.org.uk/sites/bfi.org.uk/files/downloads/bfi-press-release-christopher-nolan-season-at-bfi-southbank-in-july-2012-06-06.pdf|format=PDF |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304093423/http://www.bfi.org.uk/sites/bfi.org.uk/files/downloads/bfi-press-release-christopher-nolan-season-at-bfi-southbank-in-july-2012-06-06.pdf |archive-date=2016-03-04 |access-date=2014-03-31 |publisher=British Film Institute}}</ref>，并被认为是2000年代最具影响力的电影<ref>{{cite web|last=Rothman|first=Michael|title=''Batman Begins'': 5 Ways the Movie Changed Hollywood|publisher=ABC News|date=2019-06-16|url=https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/batman-begins-ways-movie-changed-hollywood/story?id=31802311|access-date=2022-12-03|archive-date=2020-07-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200726151554/https://abcnews.go.com/Entertainment/batman-begins-ways-movie-changed-hollywood/story?id=31802311|url-status=live}}</ref>。电影编剧伊恩·内森（Ian Nathan）写诺兰在职业生涯的五年间「从无名小卒（变成）独立电影的宠儿，再到取得好莱坞最大资产（电影）的创意控制权，并（有可能无意）激起会重新定义整个行业的流派」{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=58-59}}。

诺兰执导、共同编剧和监制《[[顶尖对决]]》（2006年），改编自{{tsl|en|The Prestige|致命魔术 (小说)|克里斯托弗·普瑞丝特的小说}}，讲述19世纪两个敌对的魔术师{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=78}}。剧本是两兄弟断断续续合作五年的结果，乔纳森早在2001年就开始创作，而诺兰也早于2003年就打算制作这部电影，但同意拍《蝙蝠侠：开战时刻》之后就推迟了这个项目{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=79}}<ref>{{Cite news |last=Fleming|first=Michael|date=16 April 2003|title=Nolan wants 'Prestige' |work=Variety |url=https://variety.com/2003/film/news/nolan-wants-prestige-1117884751 |url-status=live |access-date=2013-05-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131005094256/http://variety.com/2003/film/news/nolan-wants-prestige-1117884751/ |archive-date=2013-10-05}}</ref>。《顶尖对决》由[[休·杰克曼]]和克里斯汀·贝尔主演敌对的魔术师，获得好评之余，还入围两项奥斯卡金像奖<ref>{{cite news |last1=Child |first1=Ben |title=Prestige novelist: Christopher Nolan's Batman movies 'boring and pretentious' |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/28/prestige-novelist-christopher-nolans-batman-movies-boring-and-pretentious |access-date=2022-12-13 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |date=2014-11-28 |archive-date=2022-12-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221213170546/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/28/prestige-novelist-christopher-nolans-batman-movies-boring-and-pretentious |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |title=Oscars 2007: full list of winners and nominees |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |url=https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2007/feb/26/awardsandprizes.oscars2007|date=2007-02-26 |url-status=live |access-date=2017-07-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170815183501/https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2007/feb/26/awardsandprizes.oscars2007 |archive-date=2017-08-15}}</ref>。罗杰·埃伯特称影片为「真正的电影——大气、令人著迷、（会当）撒旦崇拜」<ref>{{Cite news|last=Ebert|first=Roger |title=Now you see him...now you see him! |url=https://www.rogerebert.com/reviews/the-prestige-2007 |date=2007-09-06 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140203004736/http://www.rogerebert.com/reviews/the-prestige-2007 |archive-date=2014-02-03 |access-date=2014-01-18 |work=RogerEbert.com|author-link=罗杰·埃伯特}}</ref>，《[[洛杉矶时报]]》的{{tsl|en|Kenneth Turan|肯尼斯·图兰}}表示其是「雄心勃勃且令人不安的情节剧」<ref>{{Cite news |first=Kenneth |last=Turan|title=They've got something up their sleeves |work=[[洛杉矶时报|Los Angeles Times]] |url=https://articles.latimes.com/2006/oct/20/entertainment/et-prestige20|date=2006-10-20 |url-status=live |access-date=2016-06-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160814051743/http://articles.latimes.com/2006/oct/20/entertainment/et-prestige20 |archive-date=2016-08-14}}</ref>。《[[卫报]]》的{{tsl|en|Philip French|菲利普·法兰奇}}写道「除了会让知识分子和研究哲学的人感到兴奋外，《顶尖对决》还引人入胜、扣人心弦、神秘、动人，及常常（带有）黑色幽默」<ref>{{Cite news|last=French|first=Philip |title=''The Prestige'' |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2006/nov/12/drama.sciencefictionandfantasy |url-status=live |access-date=2017-01-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161221084521/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2006/nov/12/drama.sciencefictionandfantasy |archive-date=2016-12-21|date=2006-11-12}}</ref>。虽然票房预测不佳，但影片还是以4000万美金的预算赚入超过1亿900万美金{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=85,94-95}}。

[[File:The Dark Knight European Premier - Leicester square2.jpg|thumb|upright=1.2|left|诺兰（左）和《[[黑暗骑士]]》剧组于2008年出席在伦敦的欧洲首映会|alt=Christopher Nolan speaking to the mic while four people are standing behind him]]

《蝙蝠侠：开战时刻》的续集《[[黑暗骑士]]》（2008年）是诺兰下个投机冒险。他起初不愿拍摄续集，但在华纳兄弟的再三坚持下只好同意{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=96-97}}。诺兰以拓宽画布来进一步说明首集的[[黑色电影|黑色]]特性和呈现出「不断发展的城市故事、大型犯罪故事……你会看到警察、司法系统、义警、穷人、富人、罪犯」<ref>{{Cite magazine|last=Jolin|first=Dan |title=''The Dark Knight'': The Original Feature |url=https://www.empireonline.com/features/dark-knight |url-status=dead |magazine=Empire |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120713133553/http://www.empireonline.com/features/dark-knight |archive-date=2012-07-13 |access-date=2013-12-23}}</ref>。诺兰还是不太用电脑合成影像，并采用高解析度IMAX录影机，成为首部有这项技术的主流电影{{sfn|Joy|2015|p=13}}<ref>{{cite news |last1=Tapley |first1=Kristopher |title=''The Dark Knight'' Set for 10th Anniversary Imax Re-Release (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2018/film/news/dark-knight-10th-anniversary-imax-re-release-1202875906/ |access-date=2022-12-04 |work=Variety |date=2018-07-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220719004545/https://variety.com/2018/film/news/dark-knight-10th-anniversary-imax-re-release-1202875906/ |archive-date=2022-07-19 |url-status=live}}</ref>。《黑暗骑士》被评为2000年代最佳电影和有史以来最佳超级英雄电影<ref name="Metadecade" /><ref name="Paste">{{Cite news |date=2009-11-03 |title=The 50 Best Movies of the Decade (2000–2009) |url=https://www.pastemagazine.com/blogs/lists/2009/11/50-best-movies-of-the-decade-2000-2009.html?p=4 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171017223108/https://www.pastemagazine.com/blogs/lists/2009/11/50-best-movies-of-the-decade-2000-2009.html?p=4 |archive-date=2017-10-17 |access-date=2011-12-14 |work=Paste}}</ref><ref name="Empiredecade">{{Cite news |title=Review of the Decade – Year-By-Year: ''Empire''{{'s}} Films of the Decade |url=https://www.empireonline.com/features/reviewofthedecade/films-of-the-decade/9.asp |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150924063908/http://www.empireonline.com/features/reviewofthedecade/films-of-the-decade/9.asp |archive-date=2015-09-24 |access-date=2012-09-04 |work=Empire}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Dockterman |first1=Eliana |title=35 Sequels That Are Better Than the Original Movie |url=https://time.com/5353143/sequels-better-than-original/ |access-date=2022-12-04 |work=Time |date=2018-08-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180830181714/https://time.com/5353143/sequels-better-than-original/ |archive-date=2018-08-30}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |title=Readers' Poll: The 15 Greatest Superhero Movies |url=https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-lists/readers-poll-the-15-greatest-superhero-movies-10865/1-the-dark-knight-256287/ |access-date=2022-12-04 |work=Rolling Stone |date=2014-04-09 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220811220136/https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-lists/readers-poll-the-15-greatest-superhero-movies-10865/ |archive-date=2022-08-11}}</ref>。许多影评人称《黑暗骑士》是「有史以来最成功的漫画电影」{{sfn|Zornado|Reilly|2021|p=166}}。《纽约时报》的{{tsl|en|Manohla Dargis|曼诺拉·达吉斯}}觉得这部电影比许多好莱坞大片具有更高的艺术水平：「其平衡艺术与商业、诗意与娱乐之间的分水岭，以（改编）漫画的种类（来说）比任何好莱坞电影都更黑暗和更深刻」<ref name="Dargis">{{Cite news |first=Manohla|last=Dargis |date=2008-07-18 |title=''The Dark Knight''-Showdown in Gotham Town |work=[[纽约时报|The New York Times]] |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2008/07/18/movies/18knig.html |url-status=live |access-date=2014-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160810124137/http://www.nytimes.com/2008/07/18/movies/18knig.html |archive-date=2016-08-10|url-access=limited}}</ref>。埃伯特持有相似看法，称「这部焦虑不安的电影超越起源故事并成为引人入胜的悲剧」<ref>{{Cite news |last= Ebert  |first=Roger|date=2008-07-16 |title=''The Dark Knight'' |work=RogerEbert.com |url=http://rogerebert.suntimes.com/apps/pbcs.dll/article?AID=/20080716/REVIEWS/55996637 |url-status=live |access-date=2014-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120102060140/http://rogerebert.suntimes.com/apps/pbcs.dll/article?AID=/20080716/REVIEWS/55996637 |archive-date=2012-01-02}}</ref>。《黑暗骑士》在上映期间缔造许多票房纪录<ref>{{Cite news |first=Brooks |last=Barnes |date=2008-07-28 |title=''Dark Knight'' Wins Again at Box Office |work=The New York Times |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2008/07/28/movies/28box.html |url-status=live |access-date= 2014-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090411150617/http://www.nytimes.com/2008/07/28/movies/28box.html |archive-date=2009-04-11|url-access=limited}}</ref>，全球入帐10亿美金<ref>{{Cite web |title=''The Dark Knight'' (2008) |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=darkknight.htm |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140221104243/http://boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=darkknight.htm |archive-date=2014-02-21 |access-date=2012-11-17 |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]]}}</ref>。电影在[[第81届奥斯卡金像奖]]入围八项，并赢得[[奥斯卡最佳音效剪辑奖|最佳音效剪辑]]（{{tsl|en|Richard King (sound designer)|理查德·金}}）和[[奥斯卡最佳男配角奖|最佳男配角]]（[[希斯·莱杰]]）<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.oscars.org/awards/academyawards/legacy/ceremony/81st-winners.html |title=The 81st Academy Awards (2009) Nominees and Winners |access-date=2022-12-02|publisher=Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences|archiveurl=https://archive.today/20141018060312/http://www.oscars.org/oscars/ceremonies/2009|archive-date=2014-10-18}}</ref>，但未能获得[[奥斯卡最佳影片奖|最佳影片]]提名而让媒体感到愤怒。奥斯卡从2010年开始将最佳影片提名从五部提升到十部，这一变化被称为「黑暗骑士规则」<ref>{{cite web |last1=Weldon |first1=Glen |title=A Superhero Movie Got a Screenplay Nomination: Glitch or Game-Changer? |url=https://www.npr.org/2018/01/25/580219918/a-superhero-movie-got-a-screenplay-nomination-glitch-or-game-changer |publisher=NPR |access-date=2022-12-10 |date=2018-01-25 |archive-date=2022-12-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221210120859/https://www.npr.org/2018/01/25/580219918/a-superhero-movie-got-a-screenplay-nomination-glitch-or-game-changer |url-status=live }}</ref>。诺兰也因这部电影的执导能力而获得{{tsl|en|List of accolades received by The Dark Knight|黑暗骑士所获荣誉列表|许多荣誉}}<ref name="nytimesawards" />。2000年代末，有报导称他会执导1960年代电视剧《[[密谍]]》的电影改编版<ref name=chapman/><ref>{{cite web|url=https://variety.com/2024/film/news/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-pay-1235938430/|title=Christopher Nolan's Final 'Oppenheimer' Payday Close to $100 Million (EXCLUSIVE)|last=Siegel|first=Tatiana|publisher=Variety|date=2024-03-12|access-date=2024-03-12|archive-date=2024-03-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240312171444/https://variety.com/2024/film/news/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-pay-1235938430/|url-status=live}}</ref>。

《黑暗骑士》的成功让华纳兄弟与诺兰签约，于是他编剧、执导和共同监制自己9年前就开始构思的电影《[[全面启动]]》（2010年）{{sfn|McGowan|2012|p=147}}。诺兰称这部电影是「以思想架构为背景的当代科幻动作片」<ref name="Tackles">{{Cite news |last=Fleming |first=Michael |date=2009-02-11 |title=Nolan tackles ''Inception'' for WB |work=Variety |url=https://www.variety.com/article/VR1117999988.html?categoryid=13&cs=1 |url-status=dead |access-date=2009-04-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090414183155/http://variety.com/article/VR1117999988.html?categoryid=13&cs=1 |archive-date=2009-04-14}}</ref>。影片由[[莱昂纳多·迪卡普里奥]]领衔主演，并群星荟萃，经上映后口碑票房双得利<ref>{{Cite news |last=Goldberg|first=Matt|date=2010-12-23 |title=Warner Bros. Keeping ''Inception'' in Oscar-voters' Minds With 'New' Behind-the-Scenes Featurette |work=Collider |url=https://collider.com/inception-oscar-featurette |url-status=live |access-date=2013-06-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170822054454/http://collider.com/inception-oscar-featurette/ |archive-date=2017-08-22}}</ref>。影评人马克·科莫德（Mark Kermode）称其为2010年最佳电影，认为「《全面启动》证明人并非愚蠢，电影不是垃圾，大片和艺术有可能是一回事」<ref name="Kermode">{{Cite AV media |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/blogs/markkermode/entries/5e3e4864-ca72-3dda-b4ab-6b8a1debc437 |title=Kermode Uncut: My Top Five Films of the Year |date=2010-12-24 |last=Kermode |first=Mark |publisher=[[BBC]] |time=5:05 |access-date=2014-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130106172155/http://www.bbc.co.uk/blogs/markkermode/2010/12/my_top_five_films_of_the_year.html |archive-date=2013-01-06 |url-status=live}}</ref>。哲学教授大卫·凯尔·约翰逊（David Kyle Johnson）写道「《全面启动》一经银幕上映就成为经典」，称赞影片探索了些哲学思想，像是{{tsl|en|leap of faith|信仰之跃}}和[[地穴寓言]]{{sfn|Johnson|2020|p=2}}。电影全球票房为8亿3600万美金<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Inception'' (2010) |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt1375666/?ref_=bo_rl_ti |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121030220255/http://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=inception.htm |archive-date=2012-10-30 |access-date=2012-11-02 |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]]}}</ref>。影片入围八座奥斯卡金像奖，包括最佳影片和[[奥斯卡最佳原创剧本奖|最佳原创剧本]]，最终赢得[[奥斯卡最佳摄影奖|最佳摄影]]、[[奥斯卡最佳音响奖|最佳混音]]、最佳音效剪辑和[[奥斯卡最佳视觉效果奖|最佳视觉效果]]<ref name="Academy Awards 2010 (83rd)">{{Cite web |title=2011 Academy Awards Nominations and Winners |url=https://www.oscars.org/oscars/ceremonies/2011/I?qt-honorees=1#block-quicktabs-honorees |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170802040831/http://oscars.org/oscars/ceremonies/2011/I?qt-honorees=1#block-quicktabs-honorees |archive-date=2017-08-02 |access-date=2017-07-26|publisher=Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences}}</ref>。诺兰也入围[[英国电影学院奖最佳导演|英国电影学院奖]]和[[金球奖最佳导演]]，及{{tsl|en|List of accolades received by Inception|全面启动所获荣誉列表|其他荣誉}}<ref name="nytimesawards" />。

[[File:Christopher Nolan, London, 2013 (crop).jpg|thumb|upright|诺兰于2013年出席《[[超人：钢铁英雄|超人：钢铁之躯]]》在伦敦的首映会|alt=Christopher Nolan is looking directly towards the camera.]]
诺兰第三部和最后一部蝙蝠侠电影《[[黑暗骑士：黎明升起]]》（2012年）上映期间，[[英国电影协会]]的约瑟夫·贝文（Joseph Bevan）写了篇有关他的简介：「在短短十多年的时间里，克里斯多福·诺兰从前途无量的英国独立导演直冲到无容置疑（拥有）有才华且超脱这个全新商标的大师」<ref name="bevan">{{cite web |last1=Bevan |first1=Joseph |title=Christopher Nolan: escape artist |url=https://www2.bfi.org.uk/news-opinion/sight-sound-magazine/features/christopher-nolan-escape-artist |publisher=British Film Institute |access-date=2022-12-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141204090138/https://www2.bfi.org.uk/news-opinion/sight-sound-magazine/features/christopher-nolan-escape-artist |archive-date=2014-12-04 |date=2012-07-18}}</ref>。诺兰起初有些犹豫，但还是同意回归执导《黑暗骑士：黎明升起》，并与弟弟和[[大卫·S·高耶]]共同开发个他觉得能为[[黑暗骑士三部曲|三部曲]]画上圆满句号的故事{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=138-139}}。电影上映后口碑不错<ref>{{Cite news|title=''The Dark Knight Rises'' receives overwhelmingly positive early reviews |url=https://www.nme.com/filmandtv/news/the-dark-knight-rises-receives-overwhelmingly-positive/275513 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160305150913/http://www.nme.com/filmandtv/news/the-dark-knight-rises-receives-overwhelmingly-positive/275513 |archive-date=2016-03-05 |access-date=2020-04-17 |work=NME}}</ref>，肯尼斯·图兰认为电影「强大、有说服力和具催眠作用」，并「不仅是卓越的超级英雄电影，更是以任何标准来说都是大师级的电影制作」<ref>{{cite news|last=Turan|first=Kenneth|url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment/movies/moviesnow/la-et-mn-dark-knight-20120719-story.html |title=Review: ''The Dark Knight Rises'' more than shines, and on many levels|work=Los Angeles Times|date=2012-07-18|access-date=2022-12-06|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210513141228/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment/movies/moviesnow/la-et-mn-dark-knight-20120719-story.html |archive-date=2021-05-13 |url-status=live}}</ref>。《[[哈芬登邮报]]》的{{tsl|en|Christy Lemire|克莉丝汀·莱米尔}}认为诺兰以「惯有的壮观、十分宏伟的方式」来结束三部曲，但不喜欢「超负荷的」故事和过度的绝望<ref>{{Cite news |last=Lemire |first=Christy |date=2012-07-16 |title=Batman Review: Is ''The Dark Knight Rises'' an Epic Letdown? |work=[[哈芬登邮报|HuffPost]] |agency= |url=https://www.huffingtonpost.com/2012/07/16/batman-review-dark-knight-rises-letdown_n_1677247.html |url-status=live |access-date=2014-03-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140317011538/http://www.huffingtonpost.com/2012/07/16/batman-review-dark-knight-rises-letdown_n_1677247.html |archive-date=2014-03-17}}</ref>。《黑暗骑士：黎明升起》票房大卖，成为第十三部收入达到10亿美金的电影<ref>{{Cite news |last=McClintock |first=Pamela |date=2012-09-02 |title=Box Office Milestone: ''Dark Knight Rises'' Crosses $1 Billion Worldwide |work=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]] |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/box-office-milestone-dark-knight-rises-warner-bros-christopher-nolan-christian-bale-367476 |url-status=live |access-date=2012-11-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140109092114/http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/box-office-milestone-dark-knight-rises-warner-bros-christopher-nolan-christian-bale-367476 |archive-date=2014-01-09}}</ref>。一名持枪歹徒在[[科罗拉多州]][[奥罗拉 (科罗拉多州)|奥罗拉]]的影院播放这部电影时[[2012年奥罗拉枪击事件|向内开火]]，造成12死58伤{{sfn|Koole et al.|2013|pp=147-148}}。诺兰发表声明，向他称之为「愚蠢悲剧」下的受害者表示哀悼<ref>{{Cite news |last=Morley|first=Will|date=2012-07-20|title=Christopher Nolan on Theater Shooting: 'I Would Like to Express Our Profound Sorrow' |url=http://insidemovies.ew.com/2012/07/20/christopher-nolan-dark-knight-rises-shooting-statement |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120721130638/http://insidemovies.ew.com/2012/07/20/christopher-nolan-dark-knight-rises-shooting-statement/ |archive-date=2012-07-21 |access-date=2022-12-06|work=[[娱乐周刊|Entertainment Weekly]]}}</ref>。

《蝙蝠侠》三部曲激发出未来超级英雄电影的趋势，并尝试复制其不加掩饰且具现实感的风格，但收效甚微。在最近的超级英雄电影未能达到预期时，第二部尤其复兴这一类型<ref name="Child2015">{{cite news |last1=Child |first1=Ben |title=Christopher Nolan's Batman movies will endure |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2015/jan/12/christopher-nolan-batman-movies-superhero-escapism-fad |access-date=2022-12-06 |work=The Guardian |date=2015-01-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220131223820/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2015/jan/12/christopher-nolan-batman-movies-superhero-escapism-fad |archive-date=2022-01-31 |url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Sims |first1=David |title=''The Dark Knight'' Changed Hollywood Movies Forever |url=https://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2018/07/the-dark-knight-legitimized-the-superhero-movie-for-better-and-worse/565448/ |access-date=2022-12-11 |work=The Atlantic |date=2018-07-18 |url-status=live |url-access=subscription|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220310192048/https://www.theatlantic.com/entertainment/archive/2018/07/the-dark-knight-legitimized-the-superhero-movie-for-better-and-worse/565448/|archive-date=2022-03-10}}</ref>。《卫报》的本·柴尔德（Ben Child）称这三部电影「在未来数十年还是该类型中最激动人心的图腾」<ref name="Child2015"/>。在讨论《黑暗骑士：黎明升起》的故事时，高耶告诉诺兰自己对《[[超人：钢铁英雄|超人：钢铁之躯]]》（2013年）的想法，于是后者负责监制此片<ref>{{cite news |last1=Dibdin |first1=Emma |title=''Dark Knight'' inspired ''Man of Steel'' |url=https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a468532/man-of-steel-writer-david-s-goyer-inspired-by-dark-knight-rises/ |access-date=2022-12-30 |work=Digital Spy |date=2013-03-26 |archive-date=2022-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221230201626/https://www.digitalspy.com/movies/a468532/man-of-steel-writer-david-s-goyer-inspired-by-dark-knight-rises/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。诺兰十分喜欢[[查克·史奈德|查克·史奈德]]的《[[300壮士：斯巴达的逆袭|斯巴达三百勇士]]》（2006年）和《[[守护者 (电影)|守护者]]》（2009年），所以聘请他来执导<ref>{{Cite news |last=Itzkoff |first=Dave|date=2013-05-22 |title=Alien, Yet Familiar |work=The New York Times |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/movies/man-of-steel-aims-to-make-superman-relevant-again.html |url-status=live |access-date=2013-05-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130523184437/http://www.nytimes.com/2013/05/26/movies/man-of-steel-aims-to-make-superman-relevant-again.html |archive-date=2013-05-23|url-access=limited}}</ref>。《超人：钢铁之躯》由[[亨利·卡维尔]]主演得知自己是个强大外星人的[[克拉克·肯特 (DC扩展宇宙)|克拉克·肯特]]，虽评价褒贬不一，但还是以2亿2000万美金的预算赚进超过6亿6000万美金的票房<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Man of Steel'' Reviews |url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/man-of-steel |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140706192545/http://www.metacritic.com/movie/man-of-steel |archive-date=2014-07-06 |access-date=2013-06-12 |publisher=[[Metacritic]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=''Man of Steel'' |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt0770828/ |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]] |access-date=2022-12-31 |archive-date=2022-12-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221217133914/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt0770828/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

=== 《星际穿越》、《敦克尔克大行动》与其他活动（2014至2019年） ===
[[File:Jonathan Nolan by Gage Skidmore.jpg|thumb|left|upright|诺兰和弟弟[[乔纳森·诺兰|乔纳森]]（摄于2017年）一起写了几部剧本，包括《星际穿越》|alt=Jonathan Nolan is looking to his left]]
诺兰接下来执导、编剧和监制科幻片《[[星际穿越]]》（2014年），剧本初稿由乔纳森·诺兰创作，导演原定是[[斯蒂芬·斯皮尔伯格]]{{sfn|Nathan|2022|pp=160-161}}。影片根据[[理论物理学|理论物理学家]][[基普·索恩]]的科学理论，讲述一群[[宇航员]]穿越[[虫洞]]去寻找人类新家园<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jagernauth|first=Kevin |date= 2013-01-10 |title=Christopher Nolan's Merging an Original Idea with Jonah Nolan's Old Screenplay for ''Interstellar'' |url=http://blogs.indiewire.com/theplaylist/christopher-nolans-merging-an-original-idea-with-jonah-nolans-old-screenplay-for-interstellar-20130110 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130112010928/http://blogs.indiewire.com/theplaylist/christopher-nolans-merging-an-original-idea-with-jonah-nolans-old-screenplay-for-interstellar-20130110 |archive-date=2013-01-12 |access-date=2013-01-13 |publisher=IndieWire}}</ref>。诺兰于2014年讨论电影的物理学时，表达出对[[客观规律|科学客观规律]]的欣赏，并希望这能应用在「我们文明的方方面面」<ref name="ThorneNolan">{{Cite magazine |last=Kluger|first=Jeffery|title=Watch Christopher Nolan and Kip Thorne Discuss the Physics of ''Interstellar'' |url=https://time.com/3602525/christopher-nolan-physics-interstellar-kip-thorne/ |url-status=live |magazine=Time |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160214175028/http://time.com/3602525/christopher-nolan-physics-interstellar-kip-thorne/ |archive-date=2016-02-14 |access-date=2017-08-15|date=2014-11-24}}</ref>。《星际穿越》由[[马修·麦康纳]]、[[安妮·海瑟薇]]和[[杰西卡·查斯坦]]主演，受到好评之余，全球票房为7亿7300万美金<ref>{{Cite web |title=''Interstellar'' Reviews |url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/interstellar |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170804225550/http://www.metacritic.com/movie/interstellar |archive-date=2017-08-04 |access-date=2014-11-13 |publisher=[[Metacritic]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=''Interstellar'' (2014) |url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt0816692/?ref_=bo_rl_ti |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150316082328/http://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=interstellar.htm |archive-date=2015-03-16 |access-date=2015-01-12 |publisher=[[Box Office Mojo]]}}</ref>。《纽约时报》的{{tsl|en|A. O. Scott|A·O·史考特}}表示《星际穿越》「视觉炫目，主题有野心」，并认为其是「充斥著悲痛、恐惧和后悔的大型未来主义冒险」<ref>{{Cite news |title=Off to the Stars, with Grief, Dread and Regret |work=The New York Times |date=2014-11-04 |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/05/movies/interstellar-christopher-nolans-search-for-a-new-planet.html |url-status=live |access-date=2016-07-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160828121417/http://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/05/movies/interstellar-christopher-nolans-search-for-a-new-planet.html |archive-date=2016-08-28|last1=Scott |first1=A. O.|url-access=limited}}</ref>。纪录片导演{{tsl|en|Toni Myers|托妮·梅耶斯}}称这部电影是「真正的艺术作品」，并称赞其探索了跨越多代的故事<ref>{{Cite web |first=Richard |last=Trenholm|title=Space station film school: How astronauts shot this glorious IMAX movie |url=https://www.cnet.com/science/space-station-film-school-how-astronauts-shot-this-glorious-imax-documentary/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160610145325/http://www.cnet.com/news/space-station-film-school-how-astronauts-shot-this-glorious-imax-documentary/ |date=2016-06-10|archive-date=2016-06-10 |access-date=2016-01-27 |publisher=CNET}}</ref>。《星际穿越》科学性上的准确性尤其广受赞誉，有两篇[[科学文献|学术论文]]因此发表{{sfn|James et al.|2015a}}{{sfn|James et al.|2015b}}，《{{tsl|en|American Journal of Physics|美国物理学期刊}}》甚至呼吁学校科学课播放这部电影<ref>{{Cite news |last=Ghosh |first=Pallab |date=2015-06-23 |title=''Interstellar'' 'should be shown in school lessons' |publisher=[[BBC News]] |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-33173197 |url-status=live |access-date=2015-06-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150624075813/http://www.bbc.com/news/science-environment-33173197 |archive-date=2015-06-24}}</ref>{{sfn|James et al.|2015b|p=486}}。电影在[[第87届奥斯卡金像奖]]赢得最佳视觉效果，并获得其他四项提名<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=D'Addario|first=Daniel|date=2015-01-15 |title=Oscars 2015: See the Full List of Nominees |url=http://time.com/3668006/oscars-2015-nominations/ |url-status=live |magazine=Time |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150115180510/http://time.com/3668006/oscars-2015-nominations/ |archive-date=2015-01-15 |access-date=2015-01-16}}</ref>。同样于2014年，诺兰和艾玛·汤玛斯担任长期合作的电影摄影师[[禾利·费斯达|沃利·菲斯特]]的导演处女作《[[全面进化|全面进化]]》的执行制作人<ref>{{Cite news |last=Kit |first=Borys |date=2012-06-13 |title=Christopher Nolan to Exec Produce Wally Pfister's Directorial Debut |work=The Hollywood Reporter |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/christopher-nolan-wally-pfister-dark-knight-rises-337015 |url-status=live |access-date=2012-10-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120922192453/http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/christopher-nolan-wally-pfister-dark-knight-rises-337015 |archive-date=2012-09-22}}</ref>。

2010年代中旬，诺兰参与多项电影保存的活动和发行名不见经传导演的作品，他的切分音制片公司还与{{tsl|en|Zeitgeist Films|时代精神影业}}合资来发行后者电影的[[蓝光光碟]]<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=McNary |first=Dave |date=2015-02-19 |title=Christopher Nolan's Syncopy Teaming With Zeitgeist on Blu-ray Releases (Exclusive) |url=https://variety.com/2015/film/news/christopher-nolans-syncopy-teaming-with-zeitgeist-on-blu-ray-releases-exclusive-1201437195/ |url-status=live |magazine=Variety |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150224023820/http://variety.com/2015/film/news/christopher-nolans-syncopy-teaming-with-zeitgeist-on-blu-ray-releases-exclusive-1201437195/ |archive-date=2015-02-24 |access-date=2015-02-23}}</ref>。诺兰执导讲述{{tsl|en|Brothers Quay|奎氏兄弟}}的动画纪录短片《[[奎氏兄弟 (电影)|奎氏兄弟]]》（2015年），也以蓝光形式发行，并同时发起两人的戏剧巡演，播映《{{tsl|en|In Absentia (film)|写一场恶梦给你}}》、《梳子》（''The Comb''）和《{{tsl|en|Street of Crocodiles|鳄鱼街}}》。[[IndieWire]]表示这对兄弟「无疑会因诺兰而收获成千上百的粉丝，因此35毫米胶卷中的奎氏兄弟将永远是后者对电影业最重要的贡献」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Sharf |first=Zack |date=2015-08-20 |title=Why 'The Quay Brothers in 35mm' Is One of Christopher Nolan's Greatest Accomplishments |publisher=[[IndieWire]] |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2015/08/why-the-quay-brothers-in-35mm-is-one-of-christopher-nolans-greatest-accomplishments-59077/ |url-status=live |access-date=2015-08-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150821010112/http://www.indiewire.com/article/why-the-quay-brothers-in-35mm-is-one-of-christopher-nolans-greatest-accomplishments-20150820 |archive-date=2015-08-21}}</ref><ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Labrecque |first=Jeff |date=2015-07-27 |title=Christopher Nolan's next movie is a documentary short |magazine=Entertainment Weekly |url=https://www.ew.com/article/2015/07/27/christopher-nolan-short-film-quay? |url-status=live |access-date=2015-07-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150729031620/http://www.ew.com/article/2015/07/27/christopher-nolan-short-film-quay |archive-date=2015-07-29}}</ref>。诺兰提倡模拟媒介应存留下来，所以与视觉艺术家{{tsl|en|Tacita Dean|塔西塔·迪恩}}邀请美国主要电影档案馆、实验室和放映机构的代表参加2015年3月在[[J·保罗·盖蒂博物馆|盖蒂博物馆]]举行的非正式峰会《重塑电影未来》（''Reframing the Future of Film''）<ref name="filmvsdigital 2">{{Cite news |last=Foundas |first=Scott |date=2015-03-11 |title=Christopher Nolan Rallies the Troops to Save Celluloid Film |url=https://variety.com/2015/film/columns/christopher-nolan-rallies-the-troops-to-save-celluloid-film-1201450536/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150313152211/http://variety.com/2015/film/columns/christopher-nolan-rallies-the-troops-to-save-celluloid-film-1201450536/ |archive-date=2015-03-13 |access-date=2015-03-12 |work=Variety}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|first=Ben|last=Child |date=2014-07-31 |title=Tarantino and Nolan share a Kodak moment as studios fund film processing |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/jul/31/quentin-tarantino-christopher-nolan-kodak-film |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170227150531/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/jul/31/quentin-tarantino-christopher-nolan-kodak-film |archive-date=2017-02-27 |access-date=2017-02-27 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]]}}</ref>，接下来则在伦敦的[[泰特现代艺术馆|泰特现代艺术馆]]、墨西哥城的{{tsl|en|Museo Rufino Tamayo, Mexico City|鲁菲诺·塔马约博物馆|塔马约博物馆}}和[[孟买]]的{{tsl|en|Tata Theatre|塔塔剧院}}举办活动<ref>{{cite news |last1=Sahani |first1=Alaka |title=On Christopher Nolan's upcoming visit to India, celluloid in digital era and preservation of film heritage |url=https://indianexpress.com/article/lifestyle/art-and-culture/celluloid-dreams-4/ |access-date=2022-12-13 |work=The Indian Express |date=2018-03-29 |url-access=subscription |archive-date=2022-12-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221213172609/https://indianexpress.com/article/lifestyle/art-and-culture/celluloid-dreams-4/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2015年4月，诺兰加入致力于{{tsl|en|Film preservation|电影保存}}的非营利组织{{tsl|en|The Film Foundation|电影基金会 (组织)|电影基金会}}的董事会<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Fleming |first=Mike Jr. |date=2015-04-22 |title=Christopher Nolan Joins Film Foundation Board |url=https://deadline.com/2015/04/christopher-nolan-joins-film-foundation-board-1201414195/ |url-status=live |magazine=Deadline Hollywood |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150424184303/http://deadline.com/2015/04/christopher-nolan-joins-film-foundation-board-1201414195/ |archive-date=2015-04-24 |access-date=2015-04-22}}</ref>，并与马丁·斯科塞斯一起被[[国会图书馆 (美国)|国会图书馆]]任命为{{tsl|en|National Film Preservation Board|国家影片保存委员会}}的美国导演工会代表<ref>{{Cite web |date=2015-05-07 |title=DGA Congratulates Martin Scorsese and Christopher Nolan on Appointments to National Film Preservation Board |url=http://www.dga.org/News/PressReleases/2015/150507-DGA-Congratulates-Martin-Scorsese-and-Christopher-Nolan-for-NFPB-appointments.aspx |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150521043452/http://www.dga.org/News/PressReleases/2015/150507-DGA-Congratulates-Martin-Scorsese-and-Christopher-Nolan-for-NFPB-appointments.aspx |archive-date=2015-05-21 |access-date=2015-05-19 |publisher=The Directors Guild of America}}</ref>。诺兰还在{{tsl|en|Motion Picture & Television Fund|电影电视基金}}理事会任职<ref>{{Cite web |title=About Us |url=https://mptf.com/about-us/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210209111559/https://mptf.com/about-us/ |archive-date=2021-02-09 |access-date=2021-02-04 |publisher=Motion Picture & Television Fund}}</ref>。

诺兰做完查克·史奈德的《[[蝙蝠侠对超人：正义曙光|蝙蝠侠对超人：正义曙光]]》（2016年）和《[[正义联盟 (电影)|正义联盟]]》的执行制作人{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=246}}{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=247}}，便重返《[[敦克尔克大行动]]》（2017年）的导演岗位。影片改编自他自己的原始剧本，与托马斯共同监制，并讲述[[第二次世界大战|二战]]期间[[同盟国 (第二次世界大战)|同盟国]]士兵于1940年[[敦克尔克大撤退|撤离]]法国[[敦刻尔克|敦刻尔克]]海滩。诺兰认为这部电影是有著[[三联画]]结构的生存故事，希望制作出少对白、「纯感官，几乎是实验性的电影」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Golhen |first=Gaël |date=2017-02-28 |title=Exclu: Christopher Nolan et ses collaborateurs révèlent 7 infos sur ''Dunkerque'' |url=http://www.premiere.fr/Cinema/News-Cinema/EXCLU-Christopher-Nolan-et-ses-collaborateurs-revelent-7-infos-sur-Dunkerque|trans-title=Excluded: Christopher Nolan and his collaborators reveal 7 facts about ''Dunkirk'' |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170228144316/http://www.premiere.fr/Cinema/News-Cinema/EXCLU-Christopher-Nolan-et-ses-collaborateurs-revelent-7-infos-sur-Dunkerque/ |archive-date=2017-02-28 |access-date=2017-02-28 |work=Première}}</ref>。他表示自己一直等到赢得大厂信任，可以用美国预算来制作英国电影，才开拍《敦克尔克大行动》<ref>{{Cite news |last=Nolan |first=Christopher |date=2017-07-08 |title=Spitfires, flotillas of boats, rough seas and 1,000 extras: Christopher Nolan on the making of ''Dunkirk'', his most challenging film to date |work=[[The Daily Telegraph]] |url=https://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2017/07/08/spitfires-flotillas-boats-rough-seas-1000-extras-christopher/ |url-status=live |access-date=2017-07-08 |archive-url=https://archive.today/20170710035754/http://www.telegraph.co.uk/films/2017/07/08/spitfires-flotillas-boats-rough-seas-1000-extras-christopher/ |archive-date=2017-07-10|url-access=subscription}}</ref>。诺兰在拍摄前曾向斯皮尔伯格寻求建议，后者在接受《[[综艺 (杂志)|综艺]]》访问时表示：「知道也尊重克里斯（·诺兰）是世界上最有创意的电影导演，我对他的建议就是为历史剧做研究时要真诚对待，接著才是自己的想像力，就跟我在《[[抢救雷恩大兵|瑞恩]]》（的做法）一样」<ref name="LangVariety">{{Cite news |last=Lang |first=Brent |date=2017-11-08 |title=Christopher Nolan Gets Candid on the State of Movies, Rise of TV and Spielberg's Influence |url=https://variety.com/2017/film/news/christopher-nolan-dunkirk-oscars-movies-tv-spielberg-1202607836/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171108202018/http://variety.com/2017/film/news/christopher-nolan-dunkirk-oscars-movies-tv-spielberg-1202607836/ |archive-date=2017-11-08 |access-date=2017-11-09 |work=Variety}}</ref>。《敦克尔克大行动》是群演电影<ref>{{Cite news |last=McNary |first=Dave |date=2016-03-11 |title=Harry Styles, Fionn Whitehead to Star in Christopher Nolan WW2 Action-Thriller ''Dunkirk'' |work=Variety |url=https://variety.com/2016/film/news/harry-styles-one-direction-christopher-nolan-dunkirk-1201728153 |url-status=live |access-date=2016-05-07 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160504152927/http://variety.com/2016/film/news/harry-styles-one-direction-christopher-nolan-dunkirk-1201728153/ |archive-date=2016-05-04}}</ref>，取得广泛好评之余，票房成绩也十分强劲<ref>{{Cite news |last=McMillan |first=Graeme |date=2017-07-17 |title=''Dunkirk'': What the Critics Are Saying |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/dunkirk-review-roundup-what-critics-are-saying-1021889 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20170720161842/http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/heat-vision/dunkirk-review-roundup-what-critics-are-saying-1021889 |archive-date=2017-07-20 |access-date=2017-07-19 |work=The Hollywood Reporter}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=''Dunkirk'' Reviews |url=https://www.metacritic.com/movie/dunkirk/critic-reviews |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170722182106/http://www.metacritic.com/movie/dunkirk/critic-reviews |archive-date=2017-07-22 |access-date=2017-07-21 |publisher=Metacritic}}</ref><ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Keegan |first=Rebecca |date=2017-07-24 |title=How ''Dunkirk'', Summer's Boldest Box-Office Gamble, Paid Off |url=https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2017/07/dunkirk-success-christopher-nolan |url-status=live |magazine=Vanity Fair |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170727032810/http://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/2017/07/dunkirk-success-christopher-nolan |archive-date=2017-07-27 |access-date=2017-08-01}}</ref>，全球共赚进5亿2600万美金，为有史以来最高收入的二战电影<ref>{{Cite web |last=Mithaiwala|first=Mansoor|date=2017-09-15 |title=''Dunkirk'' Becomes Highest Grossing WWII Film at Global Box Office |url=https://screenrant.com/dunkirk-highest-grossing-world-war-2-movie/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191103140621/https://screenrant.com/dunkirk-highest-grossing-world-war-2-movie/ |archive-date=2019-11-03 |access-date=2019-12-13 |publisher=Screen Rant}}</ref>。《[[旧金山纪事报]]》的{{tsl|en|Mick LaSalle|米克·拉塞尔}}表示「这是有史以来最好的战争片，在外观、处理方式和对观众的影响（与其他电影）明显不同。有些电影十分罕见，可以让你摆脱当前的环境，让你完全沉浸在另种体验，以至于观看时会让你瞠目结舌，《敦克尔克大行动》就是这样的电影」<ref>{{Cite news |first=Mick |last=LaSalle|title=Not a victory, but a triumph in ''Dunkirk'' |work=San Francisco Chronicle |url=https://www.sfgate.com/movies/article/Dunkirk-is-Christopher-Nolan-s-masterpiece-11297495.php|date=2017-07-18 |url-status=live |access-date=2019-05-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190528083008/https://www.sfgate.com/movies/article/Dunkirk-is-Christopher-Nolan-s-masterpiece-11297495.php |archive-date=2019-05-28}}</ref>。电影获得[[《敦刻尔克》获奖名单|许多荣誉]]，包括诺兰首次入围[[奥斯卡最佳导演奖]]<ref name="Sharf-2020"/>。

[[File:Cannes 2018 4.jpg|thumb|upright=1.13|right|诺兰（右）与{{tsl|en|Keir Dullea|凯尔·杜拉}}、卡塔琳娜·库柏力克（Katharina Kubrick）、罗纳德·桑德斯（Ron Sanders）和{{tsl|en|Jan Harlan|简·哈兰}}出席[[第71届坎城影展]]|alt=A picture showing five people standing on a red carpet]]
2018年，诺兰监督[[斯坦利·库布里克]]《2001太空漫游》（1968年）的{{tsl|en|70 mm film|70毫米胶卷}}新版，由{{tsl|en|Original camera negative|原始摄像机负片}}制作，并由他在[[第71届坎城影展]]作引见{{sfn|Elsaesser|2020|p=43}}。《[[今日美国]]》注意到影展观众迎接这位导演「就像（见到）摇滚明星一样起立欢呼」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Mandell |first=Andrea |date=2018-05-13 |title=Christopher Nolan inspires crazed Cannes crowd, talks ''Batman'' trilogy |work=USA Today |url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2018/05/13/cannes-festival-christopher-nolan-inspires-crazed-crowd-talks-batman/605699002/ |url-status=live |access-date=2018-05-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180513200908/https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2018/05/13/cannes-festival-christopher-nolan-inspires-crazed-crowd-talks-batman/605699002/ |archive-date=2018-05-13}}</ref>。一年后，诺兰和托马斯在奎氏兄弟执导的动画短片《人偶的呼吸》（''The Doll's Breath''，2019年）被冠上执行制作人的称号<ref name="Quay-Doll">{{Cite web |date=2019-09-11 |title=''The Doll's Breath'' |url=https://www.illuminationsmedia.co.uk/the-dolls-breath/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200906110213/https://www.illuminationsmedia.co.uk/the-dolls-breath/ |archive-date=2020-09-06 |access-date=2019-09-11 |publisher=Illuminations Media}}</ref>。

=== 《TENET天能》和《奥本海默》（2020年至今） === 
科幻片《[[TENET天能]]》（2020年）被《[[星期日泰晤士报]]》的{{tsl|en|汤姆·香妮}}称作「在所有诺兰风格的东西下重复震撼世界」，为他的下部导演作品<ref>{{Cite news |last=Shone |first=Tom|date=2020-08-23 |title=Film review: ''Tenet'' |url=https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/film-review-tenet-2q6btbzrl |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200823183242/https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/film-review-tenet-2q6btbzrl |archive-date=2020-08-23 |access-date=2020-08-23 |work=The Sunday Times|url-access=subscription}}</ref>。诺兰仔细思考了剧本中心思想十多年，之后花了五年多来创作<ref name="Maytum-Jun2020">{{Cite magazine |last=Maytum |first=Matt |date=2020-06 |title=Time to Spy |magazine=Total Film |issue=299 |pages=30–35}}</ref>。《TENET天能》因[[2019冠状病毒病疫情|2019冠状病毒病]]推迟上映三次，并是疫情封城后首部在影院开场的好莱坞{{tsl|en|Tent-pole (entertainment)|票房片}}<ref>{{Cite news |last=Pamela, McClintock |date=2020-09-06 |title=Box Office: ''Tenet'' Debuts to $20M as U.S. Theaters Reopen, Nears $150M Globally |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/box-office-tenet-opens-to-20m-as-u-s-theaters-reopen-nears-150m-globally |url-status=live |work=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]] |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200906220921/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/box-office-tenet-opens-to-20m-as-u-s-theaters-reopen-nears-150m-globally |archive-date=2020-09-06 |access-date=2020-09-07}}</ref>。电影讲述无名主角（[[约翰·大卫·华盛顿]]饰）穿越时空去阻止威胁世界的袭击<ref>{{cite news |last1=Jones |first1=Nate |title=A Beat-by-Beat Explanation of What Happens in ''Tenet'' |url=https://www.vulture.com/2020/09/tenet-explained-whats-going-on-in-the-plot-of-this-movie.html |access-date=2022-12-13 |work=Vulture |date=2020-09-04 |archive-date=2022-12-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221213164958/https://www.vulture.com/2020/09/tenet-explained-whats-going-on-in-the-plot-of-this-movie.html |url-status=live }}</ref>，以2亿美金的制作预算赚进3亿6300万美金，为诺兰首部票房不佳的影片{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=199}}。《TENET天能》是导演职业生涯中评价最两极分化的作品，评论界称赞执导，但认为故事令人困惑<ref>{{cite web |title=''Tenet'' |url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/tenet |publisher=[[Rotten Tomatoes]] |access-date=2022-12-15 |archive-date=2020-08-26 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200826154802/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/tenet |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="Sharf-2020">{{Cite web |last=Sharf |first=Zack |date=2020-08-21 |title=''Tenet'' Divides Critics: Nolan's Latest Called a 'Monumental Spectacle' and 'Head-Scratching' Dud |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2020/08/tenet-critics-divided-christopher-nolan-1234581611/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210109175125/https://www.indiewire.com/2020/08/tenet-critics-divided-christopher-nolan-1234581611/ |archive-date=2021-01-09 |access-date=2020-01-09 |publisher=[[IndieWire]]}}</ref>。《卫报》的{{tsl|en|Peter Bradshaw|彼得·布拉德肖}}给这部电影满分五颗星，称其是「大脑的[[装饰乐段]]，不动声色就能让发展疯狂到让人难以置信，类固醇能量和想像力都漫溢出来」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Bradshaw |first=Peter |date=2020-08-25 |title=''Tenet'' review – supremely ambitious race against time makes for superb cinema |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2020/aug/25/tenet-review-christopher-nolan-head-scratchingly-ambitious?CMP=twt_a-culture_b-gdnculture |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200925095024/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2020/aug/25/tenet-review-christopher-nolan-head-scratchingly-ambitious?CMP=twt_a-culture_b-gdnculture |archive-date=2020-09-25 |access-date=2020-08-25 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]]}}</ref>。《[[好莱坞报导]]》的莱斯利·费尔珀林（Leslie Felperin）则认为其是部「冷淡又理性的电影，很容易欣赏，尤其是因为其充斥著大胆和独创性，但几乎很难爱上，原因是其缺乏某种人性」<ref name="Felperin-2020">{{Cite news |last=Felperin |first=Leslie |date=2020-08-21 |title=''Tenet'': Film Review |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/tenet-film-review |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200822003115/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/tenet-film-review |archive-date=2020-08-22 |access-date=2020-09-08 |work=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref>。电影在[[第93届奥斯卡金像奖]]拿下最佳视觉效果和[[奥斯卡最佳艺术指导奖|最佳艺术指导]]<ref>{{Cite news |last=Hipes |first=Patrick |date=2021-03-15 |title=Oscar Nominations: The Complete List |url=https://deadline.com/2021/03/2021-oscars-nominations-full-list-of-nominees-1234714432/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210315130637/https://deadline.com/2021/03/2021-oscars-nominations-full-list-of-nominees-1234714432/ |archive-date=2021-03-15 |access-date=2021-03-15 |work=Deadline Hollywood}}</ref>。诺兰在《TENET天能》上映后，不只加入[[电影电视工程师协会]]的顾问团<ref>{{Cite news |last=Giardina |first=Carolyn |date=2020-11-10 |title=Christopher Nolan, Rob Legato Join SMPTE Engineers Advisory Board |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/behind-screen/christopher-nolan-rob-legato-join-smpte-engineers-advisory-board |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201111023619/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/behind-screen/christopher-nolan-rob-legato-join-smpte-engineers-advisory-board |archive-date=2020-11-11 |access-date=2020-11-10 |work=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref>，还担任《正义联盟》（2017年）的[[导演剪辑版]]《[[查克·史奈德之正义联盟|扎克·施奈德版正义联盟]]》（2021年）的执行制作人<ref>{{Cite web |last=Guerrasio |first=Jason |date=2021-03-10 |title=Deborah Snyder says Christopher Nolan supported her husband Zack in his quest to make the 'Snyder cut' |url=https://www.insider.com/christopher-nola-encouraged-zack-snyder-justice-league-snyder-cut-2021-3 |access-date=2021-03-15 |publisher=Insider Inc. |archive-date=2021-08-29 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210829223812/https://www.insider.com/christopher-nola-encouraged-zack-snyder-justice-league-snyder-cut-2021-3 |url-status=live }}</ref>。

[[File:ChrisNolanBFI150224 (10 of 12) (53532289710) (cropped).jpg|thumb|upright=1.2|left|诺兰出席2024年的{{tsl|en|BFI Southbank|英国电影协会南岸中心}}活动]]
诺兰的第十二部导演作品是传记片《[[奥本海默 (电影)|奥本海默]]》（2023年），取材自[[罗伯特·奥本海默|J·罗伯特·奥本海默]]（[[基利安·墨菲]]饰演）和他在[[核子武器|原子弹]]研发的角色{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=216}}。这是自《白夜追凶》以来诺兰首部[[美国电影分级制度|限制级]]电影<ref>{{cite web|author=Lupton, Drake|date=2023-06-02|url=https://collider.com/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-release-date-cast-filming/|title=''Oppenheimer'': Release Date, Cast, Trailer, and Everything We Know About Christopher Nolan's New Movie|publisher=Collider|access-date=2023-06-16|archive-date=2023-06-15|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230615212205/https://collider.com/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-release-date-cast-filming/|url-status=live}}</ref>，并由[[环球影业]]资助和发行，是自《凶心人》首部不是华纳兄弟制作的电影，原因是他对后者把合作的电影同时放在影院和[[HBO Max]]的决定感到彻底失望<ref>{{cite news |last1=Starkey |first1=Adam |title=Here's what we know about Christopher Nolan's ''Oppenheimer'' |url=https://www.nme.com/features/film-features/oppenheimer-christopher-nolan-new-film-release-date-plot-cast-explained-3282604 |access-date=2022-12-23 |work=NME |date=2022-12-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220805101035/https://www.nme.com/features/film-features/oppenheimer-christopher-nolan-new-film-release-date-plot-cast-explained-3282604 |archive-date=2022-08-05}}</ref>。诺兰与环球达成交易后，获得约1亿美金的制作预算、相同的营销预算、完全的创意控制权、百分之二十的先期总票房、100天院线窗口期和大厂的禁售期（公司不会在《奥本海默》发行前后三周发行另一部电影）<ref>{{Cite news |last=Kit|first=Borys|date=2021-09-15 |title=Inside the Studios' (and Apple's) Frenzy to Get Christopher Nolan's Next Film |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/christopher-nolan-pitch-to-studios-including-apple-seeking-his-next-film-1235014132/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210915154038/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/christopher-nolan-pitch-to-studios-including-apple-seeking-his-next-film-1235014132/ |archive-date=2021-09-15 |access-date=2021-09-16 |work=[[好莱坞报导|The Hollywood Reporter]]}}</ref>。影片广受赞誉<ref>{{cite web |title=''Oppenheimer'' |url=https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/oppenheimer_2023 |publisher=Rotten Tomatoes |access-date=2023-07-20 |archive-date=2023-07-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230719190500/https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/oppenheimer_2023 |url-status=live }}</ref>。《[[影音俱乐部]]》的马修·杰克森（Matthew Jackson）表示「《奥本海默》当之无愧称得起杰作。这是克里斯多福·诺兰目前最佳的电影，（让）我们最优秀的电影制作人（又）迈向新境界（的电影），也是能深深烙印在你脑海的电影」<ref>{{cite news |last1=Jackson |first1=Matthew |title=''Oppenheimer'' review: Christopher Nolan delivers his masterpiece |url=https://www.avclub.com/a-review-of-christopher-nolans-oppenheimer-1850654105 |work=The A.V. Club |date=2023-07-19 |access-date=2023-07-20 |archive-date=2023-07-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230720064141/https://www.avclub.com/a-review-of-christopher-nolans-oppenheimer-1850654105 |url-status=live }}</ref>。[[BBC在线|BBC文化]]的{{tsl|en|Caryn James|卡琳·詹姆士}}称片子「大胆、新颖且是（诺兰）最成熟的作品」，并称其是「《黑暗骑士》三部曲火爆、具有商业触觉的紧凑情节」加上《凶心人》、《全面启动》和《TENET天能》的「烧脑基础」<ref>{{Cite news |last=James |first=Caryn |author-link=Caryn James|date=2023-07-19 |title=Oppenheimer review: A "magnificent" story of a tragic American genius |publisher=[[BBC Culture]] |url=https://www.bbc.com/culture/article/20230719-a-magnificent-story-of-a-tragic-american-genius |url-status=live |access-date=2023-07-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230719222320/https://www.bbc.com/culture/article/20230719-a-magnificent-story-of-a-tragic-american-genius |archive-date=2023-07-19}}</ref>。《奥本海默》在全球赚取超过9亿6000万美金，成为[[2023年电影#全球票房最高的电影|2023年票房收入第三高的电影]]<ref>{{cite web |title=Top 2023 Movies at the Worldwide Box Office |url=https://www.the-numbers.com/box-office-records/worldwide/all-movies/cumulative/released-in-2023 |publisher=The Numbers |access-date=2023-08-26 |archive-date=2023-01-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230105203535/https://www.the-numbers.com/box-office-records/worldwide/all-movies/cumulative/released-in-2023 |url-status=live }}</ref>。在电影拿下的众多奖项中<ref>{{Cite news |last=Gonzalez |first=Shivani |date=2024-01-07 |title=Golden Globes Winners 2024: The Complete List |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/01/07/movies/golden-globes-winners-list.html |access-date=2024-01-08 |work=The New York Times|issn=0362-4331 |archive-date=2024-01-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240108000129/https://www.nytimes.com/2024/01/07/movies/golden-globes-winners-list.html/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news |last1=Yossman |first1=K. J. |last2=Shafer |first2=Ellise |title=BAFTA Film Awards 2024 Winners List (Updating Live) |url=https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/bafta-film-awards-2024-winners-list-1235913491/ |access-date=2024-02-18 |work=Variety |date=2024-02-18 |archive-date=2024-02-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240218173615/https://variety.com/2024/film/awards/bafta-film-awards-2024-winners-list-1235913491/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，诺兰赢得奥斯卡金像奖最佳导演及最佳影片<ref>{{Cite news |last=Barnes |first=Brooks |date=2024-03-10 |title=Oscars 2024 Highlights: 'Oppenheimer' Wins Best Picture, and Emma Stone Wins Best Actress for 'Poor Things' |url=https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/03/10/movies/oscars-academy-awards |access-date=2024-03-10 |work=The New York Times |issn=0362-4331 |archive-date=2024-03-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240310213033/https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/03/10/movies/oscars-academy-awards |url-status=live }}</ref>。

== 个人生活与形象 ==
[[File:Christopher Nolan and Emma Thomas.jpg|thumb|2011年1月，诺兰和妻子[[艾玛·托马斯]]|alt=Christopher Nolan, on the right, is looking directly towards the camera as Emma Thomas is looking to her right.]]
诺兰19岁在伦敦大学学院相识妻子艾玛·托马斯<ref name="telegraph" /><ref name="British Cinematographer pt2" />。她自1997年开始就担任诺兰所有电影的监制<ref name="syncopy">{{Cite magazine |title=The Z to A of Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.empireonline.com/features/a-z/christopher-nolan/7.asp |url-status=dead |magazine=Empire |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150924051944/http://www.empireonline.com/features/a-z/christopher-nolan/7.asp |archive-date=2015-09-24 |access-date=2014-01-18}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Meet the women behind Hollywood's iconic filmmakers |url=https://abc11.com/star-wars-wars-the-force-awakens-psycho-mad-max/1237089/ |publisher=WTVD |access-date=2022-12-17 |date=2016-03-10 |archive-date=2022-12-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221217093340/https://abc11.com/star-wars-wars-the-force-awakens-psycho-mad-max/1237089/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。两人育有4个孩子，并在洛杉矶定居<ref>{{cite news |last1=Jolin |first1=Dan |title=''Empire'' 30: My Experiences on Christopher Nolan's Movie Sets |url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/features/empire-30-christopher-nolan-set-visits/ |access-date=2022-12-13 |work=Empire |date=2020-08-18 |archive-date=2022-09-22 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220922080328/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/features/empire-30-christopher-nolan-set-visits/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。

诺兰很少接受关于宣传自己电影的采访，比较喜欢让作品保持一定的神秘感{{sfn|Joy|2015|p=3}}。他拒绝讨论个人生活<ref name="Lewis-Kraus">{{Cite news |last=Lewis-Kraus |first=Gideon |date=2014-10-30 |title=The Exacting, Expansive Mind of Christopher Nolan |work=The New York Times|url-access=limited |url=https://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/02/magazine/the-exacting-expansive-mind-of-christopher-nolan.html |url-status=live |access-date=2016-03-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160516070132/http://www.nytimes.com/2014/11/02/magazine/the-exacting-expansive-mind-of-christopher-nolan.html |archive-date=2016-05-16}}</ref>，认为过多电影导演的生平资讯会影响观众的体验，「事实上，我根本不希望人们在看电影时想起我」。作家斯图亚特·乔伊（Stuart Joy）认为诺兰不愿谈及个人生活，表明他渴望控制，这也是他作品反复出现的主题{{sfn|Joy|2015|p=3}}。

==执导风格==
诺兰的电影大部分是以[[形上学]]的主题为中心，并探索[[时间]]、[[记忆]]和[[人格同一性]]的概念{{sfn|Goh|2022|pp=4,76}}{{sfn|Blouin|2013|pp=145-146,149}}。他的作品特征有{{tsl|en|Mathematics and art|数艺|受到数学影响}}的想法和图像、非常规{{tsl|en|Nonlinear narrative|跳叙|叙事结构}}、[[唯物主义]]角度，及浮想联翩的声响使用<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Angelo |first=Mike |title=The rational wonders of Christopher Nolan |url=http://thedissolve.com/features/exposition/820-the-rational-wonders-of-christopher-nolan/ |url-status=dead|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160304083547/http://thedissolve.com/features/exposition/820-the-rational-wonders-of-christopher-nolan/|date=2014-11-14 |archive-date=2016-03-04 |access-date=2016-09-11 |website=The Dissolve}}</ref><ref name="Shone2014">{{Cite news |last=Shone |first=Tom |date=2014-11-04 |title=Christopher Nolan: the man who rebooted the blockbuster |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/04/-sp-christopher-nolan-interstellar-rebooted-blockbuster |url-status=live |work=The Guardian |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150122014558/http://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/04/-sp-christopher-nolan-interstellar-rebooted-blockbuster |archive-date=2015-01-22 |access-date=2015-01-24}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Purcell|first=Andrew|title=Christopher Nolan's final frontier |url=http://www.andrewpurcell.net/?p=2000 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150518084035/http://www.andrewpurcell.net/?p=2000 |archive-date=2015-05-18 |access-date=2015-05-07 |via=''AndrewPurcell.net'' |work=Sydney Morning Herald|date=2014-11-08}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Child |first=Ben |title=''Interstellar''{{'s}} sound 'right for an experimental film', says Nolan |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/17/interstellar-sound-christopher-nolan |date=2014-11-17 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141117151023/http://www.theguardian.com/film/2014/nov/17/interstellar-sound-christopher-nolan |archive-date=2014-11-17 |access-date=2013-07-29 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]]}}</ref>。电影导演[[吉勒摩·戴托罗]]称诺兰是「情绪化的数学家」<ref>{{cite news |last1=Aravind |first1=Ajay |title=10 Directors and Their Best Film, According to IMDb |url=https://www.cbr.com/director-best-films-imdb/ |access-date=2022-12-14 |work=Comic Book Resources |date=2022-05-30 |archive-date=2022-12-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221214210717/https://www.cbr.com/director-best-films-imdb/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。[[BBC]]的艺术编辑{{tsl|en|Will Gompertz|威尔·冈珀茨}}觉得诺兰是「艺术影院的电影导演，制作的票房大片理智又充满野心，（除了）会让你心跳加速，（也会）头晕目眩」<ref name="Gompertz-20">{{Cite web |last=Gompertz |first=Will |date=2020-08-21 |title=Tenet: Will Gompertz reviews Christopher Nolan's epic |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-53862695 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200827212521/https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-53862695 |archive-date=2020-08-27 |access-date=2020-09-01 |publisher=BBC News}}</ref>。约瑟夫·贝文写道：「他的电影能让艺术影院的常客享受超级英雄影片，多方观众（更）会沉浸在曲折离奇的情节比喻」<ref name="bevan"/>。诺兰认为自己是「大厂系统内工作的独立电影制作人」{{sfn|Molloy|2013|p=40}}。

{{Quote box|width=25%|align=right|quote=「克里斯多福·诺兰一点都不合理，而这正正是他喜欢的方式。23年间12部电影，他创造震撼人心且沉醉在自身复杂性的原创作品来对抗好莱坞法则，制片厂希望吸引到最多观众的每个行为标准他也能做到混淆视听。影院无论采取何种形式，都会填补下部诺兰电影的可能性。」|author=——电影编剧伊恩·内森于2022年谈诺兰的电影导演身份{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=5}}}}
职业哲学家和作家在16篇论文集《克里斯多福·诺兰的哲学》（''The Philosophy of Christopher Nolan''）分析诺兰的作品，他们发现当中的自我毁灭主题、真相的本质和价值，及英雄和反派的政治心态等{{sfn|LB|2017|loc=Description}}。英语文学教授罗比·B·H·戈（Robbie B. H. Goh）称诺兰是「哲学电影导演」，并把[[存在主义]]、[[道德]]、[[知识论]]和区辨表象与真实的哲学思想融入描绘悬疑、动作和暴力的电影。戈很欣赏他把主题融入具有「好莱坞爆款元素」电影的能力，这有助于保持观众沉浸其中，但同时又「比典型的消费主义动作片更深思熟虑和自反」{{sfn|Goh|2022|pp=1-4}}，更表示诺兰的作品反映了「产品情况（从低预算电影到利润丰厚大片）的异质性」、「多种类型和背景」和「宣扬他多才多艺的大量风格」{{sfn|Goh|2022|pp=12-13}}。

[[电影理论|电影理论家]]{{tsl|en|David Bordwell|大卫·博维}}认为诺兰能将自己的「实验性欲望」与主流娱乐的需求相结合，称他的所有作品「通过主观观点和交叉剪接技术在电影时代进行试验」<ref name="Bordwell2019">{{Cite web |last=Bordwell |first=David|date=2019-01-28 |title=Nolan book 2.0: Cerebral blockbusters meet blunt-force cinephilia |url=http://www.davidbordwell.net/blog/2019/01/28/nolan-book-2-0-cerebral-blockbusters-meet-blunt-force-cinephilia/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190909104313/http://www.davidbordwell.net/blog/2019/01/28/nolan-book-2-0-cerebral-blockbusters-meet-blunt-force-cinephilia/ |archive-date=2019-09-09 |access-date=2019-09-11 |work=DavidBordwell.net}}</ref>。诺兰采用的实操性镜头内效果、微缩、模型，及以赛璐珞胶片拍摄都对21世纪早期的电影形成巨大影响{{sfn|Joy|2015|p=7}}<ref name="IndieW-19">{{Cite web |last=O'Falt|first=Chris|title=Influencers: Christopher Nolan's Team Is the Big-Budget, Practical-Filmmaking Alternative |url=https://www.indiewire.com/influencers/dunkirk-production-team-nolan/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191203181719/https://www.indiewire.com/2019/12/influencers-team-christopher-nolan-1202192592/ |archive-date=2019-12-03 |access-date=2019-03-12 |publisher=[[IndieWire]]}}</ref>。IndieWire于2019年表示就算制作大片已成为「主要由计算机生成的艺术形式」时，导演「让可行的大预算电影制作替代模式幸存下来」<ref name="IndieW-19" />。由于诺兰深入参与自己电影的技术层面，斯图亚特·乔伊称他为「全面的电影制作人（……）监督制作的各个方面之余，也管理文本之外的文化和工业因素」{{sfn|Joy|2015|p=6}}。

== 认可 ==
诺兰制作了当代最具影响力和最受欢迎的电影<ref>{{Cite news |last=Itzkoff |first=Dave |date=2010-06-30 |title=A Man and His Dream: Christopher Nolan and ''Inception'' |work=The New York Times|url-access=limited |url=http://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2010/06/30/a-man-and-his-dream-christopher-nolan-and-inception/? |url-status=live |access-date=2013-12-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140105012419/http://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2010/06/30/a-man-and-his-dream-christopher-nolan-and-inception/ |archive-date=2014-01-05}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Tharpe|first=Frazier|title=The Creatives That Defined the 2010s: Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/tv-movie-creatives-that-defined-the-2010s/christopher-nolan |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201211091822/https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/tv-movie-creatives-that-defined-the-2010s/christopher-nolan |date=2019-11-22|archive-date=2020-12-11 |access-date=2019-11-23 |publisher=Complex Networks}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Carey |first1=Graeme |title=The best movies from the 2000s |url=https://www.msn.com/en-gb/entertainment/movies/the-best-movies-from-the-2000s/ss-AAV0O2z?li=BBoPJKU |date=2022-03-13 |publisher=MSN |access-date=2022-12-14 |archive-date=2022-12-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221230212749/https://www.msn.com/en-gb/entertainment/movies/the-best-movies-from-the-2000s/ss-AAV0O2z?li=BBoPJKU |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Nissim|first=Mayer|date=2013-11-06 |title=Quentin Tarantino is most-studied director in the UK |url=http://www.digitalspy.co.uk/movies/news/a529084/quentin-tarantino-is-most-studied-director-in-the-uk.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131108105528/http://www.digitalspy.co.uk/movies/news/a529084/quentin-tarantino-is-most-studied-director-in-the-uk.html |archive-date=2013-11-08 |access-date=2013-11-06 |work=Digital Spy}}</ref>。他的许多作品获评论界认证为该十年的最佳电影<ref name="Metadecade"/><ref>{{Cite web|last=Dietz|first=Jason |date=2019-12-18 |title=Best Movies of the Decade (2010–19) |url=https://www.metacritic.com/feature/best-movies-of-the-decade-2010s |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200101162640/https://www.metacritic.com/feature/best-movies-of-the-decade-2010s |archive-date=2020-01-01 |access-date=2019-12-18 |publisher=[[Metacritic]]}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last1=Phipps |first1=Keith |last2=Robinson |first2=Tasha |last3=Rabin |first3=Nathan |last4=Tobias |first4=Scott |last5=Murray |first5=Noel |date=2009-12-03 |title=The best films of the '00s |work=The A.V. Club |url=https://film.avclub.com/the-best-films-of-the-00s-1798222348 |url-status=live |access-date=2019-11-27 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20191129185236/https://film.avclub.com/the-best-films-of-the-00s-1798222348 |archive-date=2019-11-29}}</ref>，而《华尔街日报》称他「把卖座电影和艺术野心结合的能力让他在业界具有非凡的影响力」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Fritz |first=Ben |title=Why Hollywood Loves ''Interstellar'' Director Christopher Nolan |work=The Wall Street Journal |url=https://www.wsj.com/articles/why-hollywood-loves-interstellar-director-christopher-nolan-1414677657 |url-status=live |access-date=2014-10-30|date=2014-10-30 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141102063958/http://online.wsj.com/articles/why-hollywood-loves-interstellar-director-christopher-nolan-1414677657 |archive-date=2014-11-02|url-access=subscription}}</ref>。诺兰的电影赚入50亿美金<ref>{{cite news |title=As Bollywood reckons with uncertain future, a throwback to when Christopher Nolan called Hindi films 'fundamental' |url=https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/bollywood/as-bollywhen-christopher-nolan-called-bollywood-films-fundamental-8058412/ |access-date=2022-12-24 |work=The Indian Express |date=2022-07-30 |archive-date=2022-12-24 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221224203026/https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/bollywood/as-bollywhen-christopher-nolan-called-bollywood-films-fundamental-8058412/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，而《凶心人》和《黑暗骑士》因具有「文化、历史和美学」意义被美国国会图书馆选择保存在[[国家影片登记表]]<ref name="NFR1">{{Cite news |first= Cynthia|last= Littleton|date=2017-12-13 |title=''Titanic'', ''The Goonies'', ''Field of Dreams'', ''Memento'' Added to National Film Registry |url=https://variety.com/2017/film/news/the-goonies-titanic-field-of-dreams-die-hard-national-film-registry-1202638298/ |url-status=live |work=Variety |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171213101146/http://variety.com/2017/film/news/the-goonies-titanic-field-of-dreams-die-hard-national-film-registry-1202638298/ |archive-date=2017-12-13 |access-date=2017-12-13}}</ref><ref name="NFR2">{{Cite news |last=Mcnary |first=Dave |date=2020-12-14 |title=''Dark Knight'', ''Shrek'', ''Grease'', ''Blues Brothers'' Added to National Film Registry |url=https://variety.com/2020/film/news/dark-knight-shrek-grease-blues-brothers-national-film-registry-1234852610/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201214153224/https://variety.com/2020/film/news/dark-knight-shrek-grease-blues-brothers-national-film-registry-1234852610/amp/ |archive-date=2020-12-14 |access-date=2020-12-14 |work=Variety}}</ref>。上述电影与《全面启动》出现在[[英国广播公司21世纪百大电影]]和《好莱坞报导》的有史以来最佳电影票选<ref>{{Cite web |date=2016-08-23 |title=The 21st Century's 100 greatest films |url=http://www.bbc.com/culture/story/20160819-the-21st-centurys-100-greatest-films |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170131124228/http://www.bbc.com/culture/story/20160819-the-21st-centurys-100-greatest-films |archive-date=2017-01-31 |access-date=2017-01-21 |publisher=[[BBC]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite news| title=Hollywood's 100 Favorite Films | url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/100-best-films-ever-hollywood-favorites-818512/ | date=2014-06-25 | work=The Hollywood Reporter | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190705214119/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/100-best-films-ever-hollywood-favorites-818512/item/ghostbusters-hollywoods-100-favorite-films-818454 |archive-date=2019-07-05 |url-status=live| access-date=2022-12-08}}</ref>。2017年，《黑暗骑士》、《全面启动》和《星际效应》入选《[[帝国杂志|帝国]]》评选的「百大电影」<ref>{{Cite web |date=2017-06-23 |title=The 100 Greatest Movies |url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/features/best-movies/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://archive.today/20171129203213/https://www.empireonline.com/movies/features/best-movies/ |archive-date=2017-11-29 |access-date=2017-08-29 |work=Empire}}</ref>。2018年，《好莱坞报导》把诺兰列入百位最有影响力的娱乐界人物，并称他是「属于自己的特许经销权」<ref>{{Cite news |editor-last=Brower|editor-first=Alison|date=2018-09-20 |title=''The Hollywood Reporter'' 100: The Most Powerful People in Entertainment 2018 |work=The Hollywood Reporter |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/thr-100-hollywood-reporters-powerful-people-entertainment-1142979/item/thr-100-2018-randy-freer-1143892 |url-status=live |access-date=2020-04-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200925095058/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/lists/thr-100-hollywood-reporters-powerful-people-entertainment-1142979/item/thr-100-2018-randy-freer-1143892 |archive-date=2020-09-25}}</ref>。《{{tsl|en|Parade (magazine)|巡礼杂志|巡礼}}》在2022年的有史以来75名最佳导演把诺兰排在第8<ref>{{cite news |last1=Reinstein |first1=Mara |title=The 75 Best Movie Directors of All Time |url=https://parade.com/1048720/maramovies/best-directors/ |access-date=2022-12-01 |work=Parade |date=2022-11-02 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221127043804/https://parade.com/1048720/maramovies/best-directors/ |archive-date=2022-11-27}}</ref>。

[[File:National Film Registry logo vector.svg|thumb|upright=1.1|right|诺兰的两部电影《[[凶心人]]》和《[[黑暗骑士]]》被[[国会图书馆 (美国)|国会图书馆]]选择保存在[[国家影片登记表]]<ref name="NFR1"/><ref name="NFR2"/>|alt=Four-color National Film Registry logo on black background]]
诺兰的作品「受到普通电影迷、影评人和电影学者的热烈欢迎、分析和争论」<ref name="Lewis-Kraus" /><ref name="Descriptions">{{Cite web |date=2012-11-27 |title=An Evening With Christopher Nolan |url=http://www.ifccenter.com/films/an-evening-with-christopher-nolan |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130724221708/http://www.ifccenter.com/films/an-evening-with-christopher-nolan/ |archive-date=2013-07-24 |access-date=2013-07-06 |publisher=IFC Center}}</ref>。英国电影协会的{{tsl|en|Geoff Andrew|杰夫·安德鲁}}称诺兰是「有说服力的创意说书人」，并觉得他是好莱坞主流电影中为数不多的当代导演会制作高度私人化的作品。安德鲁更表示诺兰的电影值得留意「并非大量的精湛技术和视觉天赋，而是出色的叙事独创性和对复杂的哲学问题有著异常成熟的兴趣」<ref>{{Cite news |year=2012 |title=Christopher Nolan |publisher=British Film Institute |url=https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/Online/default.asp?doWork::WScontent::loadArticle=Load&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::article_id=92EC9074-583B-4953-AAFA-52B5F705731C |url-status=live |access-date=2014-03-17 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180620180635/https://whatson.bfi.org.uk/Online/default.asp?doWork::WScontent::loadArticle=Load&BOparam::WScontent::loadArticle::article_id=92EC9074-583B-4953-AAFA-52B5F705731C |archive-date=2018-06-20}}</ref>。大卫·博维指出诺兰「被认为是最有成就的在世电影导演」，并引证他有能力把类型片变成艺术片和事件电影，及他的票房数字、好评和在电影观众的受欢迎程度<ref name="Bordwell2019" /><ref name="BordwellDunkirk">{{Cite web |author=Bordwell, David|title=''Dunkirk'' Part 2: The art film as event movie |url=http://www.davidbordwell.net/blog/2017/08/09/dunkirk-part-2-the-art-film-as-event-movie/ |date=2017-08-09|url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170810170522/http://www.davidbordwell.net/blog/2017/08/09/dunkirk-part-2-the-art-film-as-event-movie/ |archive-date=2017-08-10 |access-date=2017-08-10 |work=DavidBordwell.net}}</ref>。2008年，菲利普·法兰奇认为诺兰是「（21）世纪首位重要人才」<ref name="French-50">{{Cite news |last=French|first=Philip|title=The top 50|date= 2008-04-13 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]] |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2008/apr/13/features.culture2 |url-status=live |access-date=2019-04-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150227024901/http://www.theguardian.com/film/2008/apr/13/features.culture2 |archive-date=2015-02-27}}</ref>。马克·科莫德称赞诺兰带来了「艺术影院独立电影制作的控制能力和行为准则，并应用在好莱坞大片。他就是你不需要吸引品位低俗的观众也能获利的活生生例子」<ref>{{Cite news|last=East|first=Ben |date=2013-06-14 |title=Newsmaker: Christopher Nolan is a different kind of storyteller |work=The National |url=http://www.thenational.ae/lifestyle/newsmaker-christopher-nolan-is-a-different-kind-of-storyteller#page2 |url-status=live |access-date=2014-02-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140223144206/http://www.thenational.ae/lifestyle/newsmaker-christopher-nolan-is-a-different-kind-of-storyteller#page2 |archive-date=2014-02-23}}</ref>。《[[观察家报]]》的瑞恩·吉尔贝（Ryan Gilbey）觉得诺兰是「技巧娴熟且格调高雅的说书人，能结合史匹柏的壮观场面和{{tsl|en|Nicolas Roeg|尼可拉斯·罗吉|尼古拉斯·洛}}或[[亚伦·雷奈|亚伦·雷奈]]的智力错综复杂」<ref name="Observer17">{{Cite web |last=Gilbey |first=Ryan |date=2017-07-23 |title=Christopher Nolan: from superheroes to ''Dunkirk''{{'s}} small tales of heroism |url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/jul/22/christopher-nolan-dunkirk-batman-observer-profile-profile |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190630131849/https://www.theguardian.com/film/2017/jul/22/christopher-nolan-dunkirk-batman-observer-profile-profile |archive-date=2019-06-30 |access-date=2019-06-30 |work=[[卫报|The Guardian]]}}</ref>。{{tsl|en|Mark Cousins|马克·卡曾斯}}称赞诺兰会欣然接受远大想法，「好莱坞的电影导演通常会回避创意，但克里斯托弗·诺兰不会」<ref>{{Cite news |last=Cousins|first=Mark|date=2010-08-25|title=Widescreen: Hollywood's big ideas |url=https://www.prospectmagazine.co.uk/magazine/widescreen-hollywoods-big-ideas |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180720171750/https://www.prospectmagazine.co.uk/magazine/widescreen-hollywoods-big-ideas |archive-date=2018-07-20 |access-date=2018-09-05 |work=Prospect}}</ref>。《综艺》的斯科特·福恩德斯（Scott Foundas）表示诺兰是「当代首屈一指的大画布说书人」<ref>{{Cite magazine |first=Scott |last=Foundas|title=Film Review: ''Interstellar'' |url=https://variety.com/2014/film/reviews/film-review-interstellar-1201338475/ |url-status=live |magazine=Variety |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141029234605/http://variety.com/2014/film/reviews/film-review-interstellar-1201338475/ |archive-date=2014-10-29 |access-date=2014-10-30|date=2014-10-27}}</ref>，《洛杉矶时报》的{{tsl|en|Justin Chang|贾斯汀·张}}则称他是「21世纪大片制作的伟大{{tsl|en|proceduralist|程序主义者}}，及实质性细节的爱好者」<ref>{{Cite news|last=Chang|first=Justin |date=2018-08-22|title=Ten years after it changed Hollywood, ''The Dark Knight'' is back in theaters. Accept no substitutes |work=Los Angeles Times |url=https://www.latimes.com/entertainment/movies/la-ca-mn-dark-knight-10th-anniversary-20180822-story.html |url-status=live |access-date=2018-08-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180822230952/https://www.latimes.com/entertainment/movies/la-ca-mn-dark-knight-10th-anniversary-20180822-story.html |archive-date=2018-08-22}}</ref>。

诺兰受到许多同代人的称赞，而他的作品也影响了他们<ref>{{Cite news |last=Erbland |first=Kate |date=2017-06-02 |title=Duncan Jones on How He Models His Career After Christopher Nolan – Q&A |publisher=IndieWire |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2016/06/duncan-jones-warcraft-christopher-nolan-moon-mute-interview-1201682897/ |url-status=live |access-date=2019-04-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190411124616/https://www.indiewire.com/2016/06/duncan-jones-warcraft-christopher-nolan-moon-mute-interview-1201682897/ |archive-date=2019-04-11}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last1=Davis |first1=Edward |title=Exclusive: Sam Mendes Says He Was 'Not at All' Interested In Bond At First, Took Direct Inspiration From Nolan's ''Dark Knight'' Films |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2012/10/exclusive-sam-mendes-says-he-was-not-at-all-interested-in-bond-at-first-took-direct-inspiration-from-nolans-dark-knight-films-250672/ |publisher=IndieWire |access-date=2022-12-14 |date=2012-10-18 |archive-date=2022-12-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221214210716/https://www.indiewire.com/2012/10/exclusive-sam-mendes-says-he-was-not-at-all-interested-in-bond-at-first-took-direct-inspiration-from-nolans-dark-knight-films-250672/ |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{Cite magazine |date=2012-07-13 |title=''The Dark Knight'' Effect – How Hollywood fell for – and learned from – the greatest superhero sequel ever made |url=https://www.empireonline.com/movies/features/dark-knight-effect/ |url-status=live |magazine=Empire |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121113083236/http://www.empireonline.com/features/the-dark-knight-effect |archive-date=2012-11-13 |access-date=2013-01-26}}</ref>。[[简尼夫·班纳]]称诺兰拍摄大型电影的方法「对现代电影来说独一无二」，并补充「无论他的电影多么受欢迎，他还是位艺术家和具有独特风格的电影导演。我认为正因如此他已成为观众和幕后的英雄」<ref>{{cite news |title=Kenneth Branagh must evacuate soldiers trapped in ''Dunkirk'' |url=https://pop.inquirer.net/37978/kenneth-branagh-must-evacuate-soldiers-trapped-dunkirk |access-date=2022-12-14 |work=Philippine Daily Inquirer |date=2017-07-17 |archive-date=2022-12-14 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221214210718/https://pop.inquirer.net/37978/kenneth-branagh-must-evacuate-soldiers-trapped-dunkirk |url-status=live }}</ref>。[[麦可·曼恩]]称赞诺兰的「独到见解」，并觉得他是「发明了后英雄式的超级英雄」{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=19-20}}。尼古拉斯·罗伊格谈到诺兰时表示：「人们讲起『商业艺术』这个词时通常在自我否定，（但）诺兰在商业舞台从事，作品却诗情画意」{{sfn|Shone|2020|p=20}}。[[马丁·斯科塞斯]]觉得诺兰是拍出「制作精美大型电影」的电影导演<ref>{{Cite news |date=2015-10-26 |title=Martin Scorsese: There's always the budget, but I am more concerned about the creative freedom |work=Film Talk |url=http://filmtalk.org/2015/10/26/martin-scorsese-theres-always-the-budget-but-i-am-more-concerned-about-the-creative-freedom/ |url-status=live |access-date=2016-02-13 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161025044907/https://filmtalk.org/2015/10/26/martin-scorsese-theres-always-the-budget-but-i-am-more-concerned-about-the-creative-freedom/ |archive-date=2016-10-25}}</ref>。

[[达米恩·查泽雷|戴米恩·查素]]称赞诺兰有能力「让看似最没有人情味的项目，（像）超级英雄史诗片和深空烧脑片，都会变得非常个人化」<ref>{{Cite magazine |last=Bryant|first=Jacob|title=Damien Chazelle on ''Dunkirk'' |url=https://variety.com/gallery/directors-on-directors-get-out-lady-bird/#!2/dunkirk-13 |url-status=live |magazine=Variety |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171206041800/http://variety.com/gallery/directors-on-directors-get-out-lady-bird/#!2/dunkirk-13 |archive-date=2017-12-06 |access-date=2017-12-06|date=2017-12-05}}</ref>。[[斯蒂芬·斯皮尔伯格]]在讨论[[艺术电影]]和大厂大片的区别时，称诺兰的《黑暗骑士》三部曲是两者皆有的例子<ref>{{Cite AV media |title=In conversation with Steven Spielberg and Stacey Snider on The Front Row |url=http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r69N56plrDE |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131205223650/http://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&v=r69N56plrDE |archive-date=2013-12-05 |access-date=2022-12-11 |publisher=Star World|time=4:45|via=[[YouTube]]}}</ref>，并认为《记忆拼图》和《全面启动》是「大师级作品」<ref name="TIE">{{cite news |title=Christopher Nolan turns 49: Here is what Steven Spielberg, James Cameron and other directors say about him |url=https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/hollywood/happy-birthday-christopher-nolan-steven-spielberg-james-cameron-5860421/ |access-date=2022-12-11 |work=The Indian Express |date=2019-07-30|url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211223072100/https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/hollywood/happy-birthday-christopher-nolan-steven-spielberg-james-cameron-5860421/ |archive-date=2021-12-23}}</ref>。[[丹尼斯·维勒弗|丹尼斯·维伦纽瓦]]十分欣赏诺兰的能力，「他能够保持身份之余，还在大银幕创造自己的宇宙……（并把）智力概念带到现在的银幕，这十分罕见。他制作的每部电影，我都对他的作品更加钦佩」<ref>{{Cite news |last=O'Falt|first=Chris|date=2017-12-22 |title=Denis Villenueve Aspires to Be Like Christopher Nolan, and Why He Wants to Make ''Dune'' |publisher=[[IndieWire]] |url=https://www.indiewire.com/2017/12/denis-villenueve-influences-christopher-nolan-steven-spielberg-ingmar-bergman-1201904623/ |url-status=live |access-date=2017-12-23 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171223192347/https://www.indiewire.com/2017/12/denis-villenueve-influences-christopher-nolan-steven-spielberg-ingmar-bergman-1201904623/ |archive-date=2017-12-23}}</ref>。[[詹姆斯·卡梅隆]]对诺兰未能凭《全面启动》入围奥斯卡最佳导演而感到扼腕，并称这部电影「毫无疑问是年度最令人震惊的电影创作和导演作品」<ref name="TIE"/>。

