== 荣誉 ==
{{main|克里斯多福·诺兰获得的奖项和提名列表}}

[[File:Christopher Nolan TCL.jpg|thumb|right|诺兰在好莱坞[[中国戏院|格劳曼中国戏院]]前的手印和鞋印|alt=A hand and footprint reading "Christopher Nolan" at the top and "7/7/2012" at the bottom.]]

诺兰曾入围8座[[奥斯卡金像奖]]（赢得两座）、8座[[英国电影学院奖]]（赢得两座）和8座[[金球奖]]（赢得一座）<ref name="nytimesawards" />{{sfn|Nathan|2022|p=197}}<ref>{{cite web |title=Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.allmovie.com/artist/christopher-nolan-p240025/awards |publisher=[[AllMovie]] |access-date=2022-12-08 |archive-date=2022-12-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221208180637/https://www.allmovie.com/artist/christopher-nolan-p240025/awards |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Winners & Nominees |url=https://www.goldenglobes.com/winners-nominees/2018 |publisher=Hollywood Foreign Press Association |access-date=2022-12-08 |archive-date=2019-04-10 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190410155641/https://www.goldenglobes.com/winners-nominees/2018 |url-status=live }}</ref>。诺兰于2006年被任命为[[伦敦大学学院]]荣誉院士<ref>{{Cite web |year=2006 |title=Honorary Fellows of UCL |url=http://www.ucl.ac.uk/about-ucl/who-we-are/honorary-fellows |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160923115521/http://www.ucl.ac.uk/about-ucl/who-we-are/honorary-fellows |archive-date=2016-09-23 |access-date=2013-03-11 |publisher=University College London}}</ref>，并于2017年被授予文学系[[名誉学位|名誉博士学位]]<ref>{{Cite web |date=2017-09-12 |title=Back to where it all began: Christopher Nolan awarded honorary doctorate at UCL |url=http://www.ucl.ac.uk/campaign/campaign-news/christopher_nolan_honorary_doctorate |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170916074807/http://www.ucl.ac.uk/campaign/campaign-news/christopher_nolan_honorary_doctorate |archive-date=2017-09-16 |access-date=2017-09-15 |publisher=University College London}}</ref>。2011至2014年，他凭收入和知名度排进[[世界百大名人权力榜|《福布斯》世界百大名人权力榜]]<ref>{{cite news |title=Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.forbes.com/pictures/eidm45ek/christopher-nolan/?sh=1a1bb5a821bf |access-date=2022-12-15 |work=Forbes |date=2011-05-16 |archive-date=2022-12-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215183913/https://www.forbes.com/pictures/eidm45ek/christopher-nolan/?sh=1a1bb5a821bf |url-status=live }}<br>{{cite news |title=Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.forbes.com/pictures/mfl45jjii/christopher-nolan/?sh=37e68cede3df |access-date=2022-12-15 |work=Forbes |date=2012-05-16 |archive-date=2022-12-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215183911/https://www.forbes.com/pictures/mfl45jjii/christopher-nolan/?sh=37e68cede3df |url-status=live }}<br>{{cite news |title=Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.forbes.com/pictures/fimi45egge/christopher-nolan/?sh=61ce769249fc |access-date=2022-12-15 |work=Forbes |date=2013-06-28 |archive-date=2022-12-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215183911/https://www.forbes.com/pictures/fimi45egge/christopher-nolan/?sh=61ce769249fc |url-status=live }}<br>{{cite news |title=Christopher Nolan |url=https://www.forbes.com/pictures/mfl45ejldm/christopher-nolan-3/?sh=269e8ede7558 |access-date=2022-12-15 |work=Forbes |date=2014-06-27 |archive-date=2022-12-15 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221215183914/https://www.forbes.com/pictures/mfl45ejldm/christopher-nolan-3/?sh=269e8ede7558 |url-status=live }}</ref>。2012年，诺兰是在[[中国戏院|格劳曼中国戏院]]接受手足印仪式的最年轻导演<ref>{{Cite news|first=Emily |last=Rome |title=''The Dark Knight Rises'': Christopher Nolan's hand and footprint ceremony |url=https://ew.com/article/2012/07/07/christopher-nolan-hand-and-footprint-ceremony/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120808193929/http://insidemovies.ew.com/2012/07/07/christopher-nolan-hand-and-footprint-ceremony/ |archive-date=2012-08-08 |access-date=2022-12-14|work=Entertainment Weekly|date=2012-07-07}}</ref>。诺兰于2015年入选《[[时代杂志|时代]]》的[[时代百大人物|最具影响力一百人]]<ref>{{cite news|last=Caine|first=Michael|author-link=Michael Caine|url=http://time.com/3822892/christopher-nolan-2015-time-100|title=Christopher Nolan|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150417010758/http://time.com/3822892/christopher-nolan-2015-time-100/ |archive-date=2015-04-17|date=2015-04-17|access-date=2022-12-08| work=[[时代杂志|Time]]}}</ref>，并在{{tsl|en|2019 New Year Honours|2019年新年荣誉会}}因对电影的贡献而授予[[大英帝国勋章]]<ref>{{London Gazette |issue=62507 |date=2018-12-29 |page=N24 |supp=y}}</ref>。2023年，他凭《奥本海默》当中对科学家的塑造荣获[[美国科学家联盟]]的公共服务奖<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro |first=Anthony |date=2023-10-10 |title=Christopher Nolan To Be Lauded For 'Oppenheimer' By The Federation of American Scientists |url=https://deadline.com/2023/10/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-federation-of-american-scientists-awards-1235569081/ |access-date=2023-10-19 |website=Deadline |archive-date=2023-10-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231016185435/https://deadline.com/2023/10/christopher-nolan-oppenheimer-federation-of-american-scientists-awards-1235569081/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。2024年，诺兰以「对影业有非凡成就和巨大贡献」而获得[[英国电影协会会士]]<ref>{{Cite web |last=Roxborough |first=Scott |date=2023-12-04 |title=Christopher Nolan to Get BFI Fellowship |url=https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/christopher-nolan-to-receive-bfi-fellowship-1235709538/ |access-date=2023-12-04 |website=The Hollywood Reporter|archive-date=2023-12-04 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231204150301/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/christopher-nolan-to-receive-bfi-fellowship-1235709538/ |url-status=live }}</ref>，并以「持续突破叙事界线」获得{{tsl|en|Académie des Arts et Techniques du Cinéma|法国电影艺术与技术学院}}的{{tsl|en|Honorary César|荣誉凯撒奖}}<ref>{{Cite web |last=Goodfellow |first=Melanie |date=2024-01-19 |title=Christopher Nolan To Be Feted In France With Honorary César |url=https://deadline.com/2024/01/christopher-nolan-france-honorary-cesar-1235797659/ |access-date=2024-01-19 |website=Deadline |archive-date=2024-01-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240119154836/https://deadline.com/2024/01/christopher-nolan-france-honorary-cesar-1235797659/ |url-status=live }}</ref>。同年3月，诺兰因对电影的贡献被授予[[下级勋位爵士|爵士勋衔]]，而妻子艾玛·托马斯则被授勋为[[女爵士]]<ref>{{London Gazette |date=2024-04-22 |issue=64374 |page=7898}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |date=2024-03-28 |title=Christopher Nolan and Emma Thomas to receive a knighthood and damehood |url=https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-68683313 |access-date=2024-03-28 |work=BBC News |archive-date=2024-03-28 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328184256/https://www.bbc.com/news/entertainment-arts-68683313 |url-status=live }}</ref>。

