'''吉尔·基能'''（{{langx|en|Gil Kenan}}，{{bd|1976年|10月16日}}），英国和美国男导演、编剧、制片人及动画师，知名于电影《[[怪怪屋]]》（2006）和《[[微光城市]]》（2008）。

== 早期生活 ==
吉尔·基能生于[[伦敦]]的犹太家庭。3岁时，家人移民至以色列[[特拉维夫]]。<ref name="bg1">{{Cite web|url=https://jewishjournal.com/culture/arts/14446/scary-monster-house-comes-direct-from-the-basement/|title=Scary 'Monster House' comes direct from the basement|date=2007-02-23|website=Jewish Journal|access-date=2021-12-23|archive-date=2021-12-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211202030104/https://jewishjournal.com/culture/arts/14446/scary-monster-house-comes-direct-from-the-basement/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="bg2">{{Cite news|url=https://www.ynetnews.com/articles/0,7340,L-3288114,00.html|title=Israeli producer in US tunes in to voices from home|first=Amir|last=Kaminer|newspaper=Ynetnews|date=2006-08-09|via=www.ynetnews.com|accessdate=2021-12-23|archive-date=2021-12-16|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211216165928/https://www.ynetnews.com/articles/0,7340,L-3288114,00.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>他有一个兄弟<ref name="KenanInterview">{{Cite web |last=Awalt |first=Steven |date=2021-09-27 |title=Into the 'Monster House' |url=https://amblin.com/article/into-the-monster-house/ |url-status=no |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210928005046/https://amblin.com/article/into-the-monster-house/ |archive-date=2021-09-28 |access-date=2021-09-27 |website=[[安培林娱乐|Amblin Entertainment]] }}</ref>。8岁时，随家人搬到美国[[加利福尼亚州]][[洛杉矶]]的{{le|雷塞达 (洛杉矶)|Reseda, Los Angeles|雷塞达}}<ref name=EWHouseBeautiful />。

基能就读于{{le|加州大学洛杉矶分校戏剧影视学院|UCLA School of Theater, Film and Television}}，2002年凭借动画成就顺利取得[[艺术创作硕士]]学位<ref name=AWNFestivals2002>{{cite news|last=Furniss|first=Maureen|title=Fresh from the Festivals: November 2002's Film Reviews|url=http://www.awn.com/animationworld/fresh-festivals-november-2002s-film-reviews|access-date=2014-01-23|newspaper=Animation World Network|date=2002-11-27|archive-date=2014-02-02|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140202104552/http://www.awn.com/animationworld/fresh-festivals-november-2002s-film-reviews|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=UCLAMag />。他制作了一支10分钟[[定格动画|定格]]兼实拍的短片《云雀》（{{lang|en|''The Lark''}}），来作为研究生论文成果<ref name=AWNFestivals2002 /><ref name=JJBasement>{{cite news|last=Pfefferman|first=Naomi|title=Scary 'Monster House' comes direct from the basement|url=http://www.jewishjournal.com/arts/article/scary_monster_house_comes_direct_from_the_basement_20070223|access-date=2014-01-23|newspaper=Jewish Journal|date=2007-02-22|archive-date=2014-02-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140220040647/http://www.jewishjournal.com/arts/article/scary_monster_house_comes_direct_from_the_basement_20070223|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

== 个人生活 ==
2005年，基能与《微光城市》的美术总监伊丽莎·柴金（{{lang|en|Eliza Chaikin}}）结婚<ref name=EWHouseBeautiful>{{cite news|last=Daly|first=Steve|title=House Beautiful|url=https://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,1218988,00.html|access-date=2014-01-23|newspaper=Entertainment Weekly|date=2006-07-26|archive-date=2014-02-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140201222753/http://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,1218988,00.html|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=UCLAMag>{{cite news|last=Burke|first=Anne|title=Monster Man|url=http://magazine.ucla.edu/exclusives/monster-house/|access-date=2014-01-23|newspaper=UCLA Magazine|date=2006-07-14|archive-date=2014-02-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140219170718/http://magazine.ucla.edu/exclusives/monster-house/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

