'''帕亚尔·卡帕迪亚'''（{{langx|en|Payal Kapadia}}；{{bd|1986年|1月4日}}）是一位出生于[[印度]]的导演，于[[第70届坎城影展|2017年]]的坎城影展以短片《季风来临前的最后一个芒果》（{{langx|en|''The Last Mango Before the Monsoon''}}）初试啼声<ref>{{Cite web|date=2017-06-10|title=Meet FTII student Payal Kapadia, whose film Afternoon Clouds, was selected for Cannes 2017|url=https://www.firstpost.com/entertainment/meet-ftii-student-payal-kapadia-whose-film-afternoon-clouds-was-selected-for-cannes-2017-3533891.html|access-date=2021-07-20|website=Firstpost|archive-date=2024-05-07|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240507030404/https://www.firstpost.com/entertainment/meet-ftii-student-payal-kapadia-whose-film-afternoon-clouds-was-selected-for-cannes-2017-3533891.html|dead-url=no}}</ref>，并在[[第74届坎城影展|2021年]]以《{{link-en|我们一无所知的夜晚|A Night of Knowing Nothing}}》获得[[金眼睛奖]]<ref>{{Cite magazine|date=18 July 2021|title=Payal Kapadia wins best documentary award in Cannes|url=https://www.indiatoday.in/movies/hollywood/story/payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-in-cannes-1829513-2021-07-18|access-date=2021-07-20|magazine=India Today|language=en|archive-date=2024-05-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240505125133/https://www.indiatoday.in/movies/hollywood/story/payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-in-cannes-1829513-2021-07-18|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|title=Mumbai-based film-maker Payal Kapadia wins Best Documentary Award at Cannes|newspaper=The Economic Times|url=https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/magazines/panache/mumbai-based-film-maker-payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-at-cannes/articleshow/84549199.cms|agency=IANS|date=19 July 2021|access-date=2022-09-13|archive-date=2024-05-19|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240519001012/https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/magazines/panache/mumbai-based-film-maker-payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-at-cannes/articleshow/84549199.cms|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-07-18|title=Cannes 2021: India's Payal Kapadia wins best documentary award|url=https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/others/cannes-2021-india-s-payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-101626609832371.html|access-date=2021-07-20|website=Hindustan Times|language=en|archive-date=2023-10-09|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231009083027/https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/others/cannes-2021-india-s-payal-kapadia-wins-best-documentary-award-101626609832371.html|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Entertainment|first=Quint|date=2021-07-18|title=Cannes 2021: Payal Kapadia's A Night of Knowing Nothing Wins Best Documentary|url=https://www.thequint.com/entertainment/indian-cinema/mumbai-filmmaker-payal-kapadia-cannes-2021-win-a-night-of-knowing-nothing|access-date=2021-07-20|website=TheQuint|language=en}}</ref>。2024年，卡帕迪亚以《[[你是我眼中的那道光]]》获得[[第77届坎城影展|坎城影展]][[评审团大奖 (坎城影展)|评审团大奖]]。

==生平==
卡帕迪亚于1986年出生于[[孟买]]<ref>{{cite web |title=AN INTERVIEW WITH PAYAL KAPADIA ABOUT „AND WHAT IS THE SUMMER SAYING“ |url=https://shortsblog.berlinale.de/2018/02/17/an-interview-with-payal-kapadia-about-and-what-is-the-summer-saying/ |website=Berlinale |access-date=26 May 2024 |date=12 February 2018}}</ref>，母亲为画家兼影像艺术家{{le|纳里尼·马拉尼|Nalini Malani}}。卡帕迪亚国中时就读于[[安得拉邦]]的[[寄宿学校]]{{le|里希峡谷中学|Rishi Valley School}}。卡帕迪亚在中学的电影社受到[[塔可夫斯基]]和{{link-bn|李维克·伽塔克|ঋত্বিক ঘটক}}影响，并决定往电影事业发展。卡帕迪亚大学就读于{{le|孟买圣泽维尔学院|St. Xavier's College, Mumbai}}，并于{{le|索非亚女子大学|Sophia College for Women}}获得一年硕士学位<ref name=":0">{{Cite web|last=Dore|first=Bhavya|date=7 June 2017|title=Payal Kapadia: Over the Clouds|url=https://openthemagazine.com/cinema/payal-kapadia-over-the-clouds/|website=Open: The Magazine|access-date=2024-05-28|archive-date=2024-02-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240217131336/https://openthemagazine.com/cinema/payal-kapadia-over-the-clouds/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。随后，卡帕迪亚继续攻读{{le|印度电影电视学院|Film and Television Institute of India}}<ref>{{Cite web|title=Who Is Payal Kapadia? The Director Wins Best Documentary Award In Cannes|url=https://www.shethepeople.tv/drafts/who-is-payal-kapadia-indian-female-director-wins-best-documentary-award-in-cannes/|access-date=2021-07-20|language=en-US|archive-date=2021-07-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210720021717/https://www.shethepeople.tv/drafts/who-is-payal-kapadia-indian-female-director-wins-best-documentary-award-in-cannes/|dead-url=no}}</ref>，并于隔年获得学位。

