'''歌拉莉·花洁'''（{{langx|en|Coralie Fargeat}}；{{bd|1976年|11月24日||}}）是一位法国电影导演、编剧、制片人。她凭借2017年的处女作《[[浴血狂花]]》获得认可，并凭借这部电影获得多个独立电影节的奖项<ref name=":12">{{Cite web |title=The fantastic fable 'Jupiter's Moon' wins Sitges 2017 - Sitges Film Festival - Festival Internacional de Cinema Fantàstic de Catalunya |url=https://sitgesfilmfestival.com/eng/noticies?id=1003486 |website=sitgesfilmfestival.com |access-date=2021-12-07 |archive-date=2017-12-16 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171216091258/https://sitgesfilmfestival.com/eng/noticies?id=1003486 |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=":3">{{Cite web |title=MONSTER FEST Announces 2017 Award Winners! |url=https://www.monsterfest.com.au/monsterfest2017-12/ |website=Monster Fest |date=2017-11-27 |language=en-US |access-date=2021-12-07 |archive-date=2021-12-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211208075546/https://www.monsterfest.com.au/monsterfest2017-12/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=":4">{{Cite web |title=Bucheon International Fantastic Film Festival |url=http://www.bifan.kr/ |website=BIFAN |access-date=2021-12-07 |archive-date=2022-01-21 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220121164328/http://www.bifan.kr/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=":5">{{Cite web |title=2018 Awards - Calgary Underground Film Festival |url=https://www.calgaryundergroundfilm.org/2018-awards |website=www.calgaryundergroundfilm.org |access-date=2021-12-07 |archive-date=2021-12-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211208075545/https://www.calgaryundergroundfilm.org/2018-awards |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name=":6">{{Cite web |title=Revenge - Cleveland International Film Festival :: March 30 - April 10, 2022 |url=https://www.clevelandfilm.org/films/2018/revenge |website=www.clevelandfilm.org |language=en |access-date=2021-12-07 |archive-date=2021-12-08 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211208075544/https://www.clevelandfilm.org/films/2018/revenge |dead-url=yes }}</ref>。随后，她的第二部故事片《[[惧裂]]》（2024年）问世，该电影为讽刺性质的[[肉体恐怖]]片，为她赢得了[[坎城影展最佳剧本奖|戛纳电影节最佳剧本奖]]，以及[[金球奖|金球奖]][[金球奖最佳导演|最佳导演]]和[[金球奖最佳剧本|最佳剧本]]两项提名。最终她还以此片首获奥斯卡提名，一举入围最佳影片、导演、原著剧本3奖。

