'''盖瑞·道柏曼'''（{{langx|en|Gary Dauberman}}），美国男编剧、制片人和导演<ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.hollywood.com/celebrities/gary-dauberman-57650159/|title=Gary Dauberman {{!}} Biography and Filmography|last=Staff|first=Hollywood.com|date=2015-02-03|work=Hollywood.com|access-date=2017-09-28|language=en-US|archive-date=2017-12-03|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171203180227/http://www.hollywood.com/celebrities/gary-dauberman-57650159/}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://ihorror.com/interview-screenwriter-gary-dauberman-annabelle-creation/|title=[Interview] Screenwriter Gary Dauberman – Annabelle: Creation – Horror Movie News and Reviews|date=2017-07-28|work=Horror Movie News and Reviews|access-date=2017-09-28|language=en-US|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170917071533/http://ihorror.com/interview-screenwriter-gary-dauberman-annabelle-creation/|archive-date=2017-09-17|dead-url=yes}}</ref>。他较著名的是在[[厉阴宅宇宙]]中担任数部电影的编剧，如《[[安娜贝尔 (电影)|安娜贝尔]]》（2014年）、《[[安娜贝尔：造孽]]》（2017年）和《[[鬼修女]]》（2018年），而在《[[安娜贝尔回家啰]]》（2019年）中则担任导演。

== 早年 ==
盖瑞·道柏曼在{{le|特拉华县社区学院|Delaware County Community College}}念了两年后转学至[[天普大学]]，并于2002年毕业<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.tcm.com/tcmdb/person/11305499%7C0/Gary-Dauberman/biography.html|title=Biography for Gary Dauberman|website=Turner Classic Movies|access-date=2017-09-28|archive-date=2017-09-27|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170927052208/http://www.tcm.com/tcmdb/person/11305499%7C0/Gary-Dauberman/biography.html}}</ref>。

== 私生活 ==
道柏曼是[[基督徒]]<ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.gospelherald.com/articles/71234/20170809/christian-annabelle-creation-writer-why-horror-flick-faith-based-film.htm|title=Christian 'Annabelle: Creation' Writer On Why Horror Flick is 'Faith Based Film' (Exclusive Interview)|last=Herald|first=The Gospel|date=2017-08-09|work=Breaking Christian News: World, Business, and More {{!}} The Gospel Herald|access-date=2017-09-28|language=en|archive-date=2020-09-28|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200928102312/https://www.gospelherald.com/articles/71234/20170809/christian-annabelle-creation-writer-why-horror-flick-faith-based-film.htm}}</ref>。

