'''葛雷哥里·贝兰提'''（{{langx|en|Gregory Berlanti}}，{{bd|1972年|5月24日}}）或简称'''葛瑞格·贝兰提'''（{{langx|en|Greg Berlanti}}），美国男编剧、制片人和导演。以制作多部著名电视剧而闻名，如《[[恋爱时代 (美国电视剧)|恋爱时代]]》、《[[兄弟姐妹 (美国电视剧)|兄弟姐妹]]》、《[[雪山镇 (电视剧)|雪山镇]]》、《[[政坛野兽]]》、《[[河谷镇 (电视剧)|河谷镇]]》、《[[莎宾娜的颤栗冒险]]》和《[[安眠书店 (电视剧)|安眠书店]]》；而他也为改编自[[DC漫画]]、于[[CW电视台]]播出的[[绿箭宇宙]]有著重要的贡献。

2018年，贝兰提制作的十五部真人电视剧已预定于[[2018年－2019年美国电视网节目表|2018年－2019年美国电视季]]在各大平台发行<ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.hollywoodreporter.com/live-feed/greg-berlanti-cusp-making-tv-history-1003526|title=Greg Berlanti on the Cusp of Making TV History|work=The Hollywood Reporter|access-date=2018-03-17|language=en|archive-date=2021-01-26|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210126153224/https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/live-feed/greg-berlanti-cusp-making-tv-history-1003526|dead-url=no}}</ref>，并签下了[[华纳兄弟]]至今最昂贵的制片人合约<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2018/06/greg-berlanti-mega-300-million-overall-deal-warner-bros-tv-through-2024-1202405581/|title=Greg Berlanti Inks Mega $300+ Million New Overall Deal To Stay At Warner Bros. TV Through 2024|website=Deadline Hollywood|author=Nellie Andreeva|date=2018-06-07|access-date=2019-06-14|archive-date=2020-11-24|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201124205254/https://deadline.com/2018/06/greg-berlanti-mega-300-million-overall-deal-warner-bros-tv-through-2024-1202405581/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2018-10-04/netflix-is-forcing-hollywood-into-a-talent-war|title=The Hollywood Empire Strikes Back Against Netflix|last=Shaw|first=Lucas|date=2018-10-04|work=Bloomberg L.P.|access-date=2019-06-14|archive-date=2019-08-05|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190805192213/https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2018-10-04/netflix-is-forcing-hollywood-into-a-talent-war|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2019年，他又凭借著新参与的三部电视剧而使他的电视制作量提升至破纪录的十八部<ref>{{cite web|url=https://deadline.com/2019/05/producer-greg-berlanti-new-series-record-strong-upfront-prodigal-son-katy-keene-batwoman-1202612375/|title=Producer Greg Berlanti Sets New Series Record With Another Strong Upfront|first1=Nellie|last1=Andreeva|first2=Nellie|last2=Andreeva|date=2019-05-11|publisher=Deadline|access-date=2019-06-14|archive-date=2020-07-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200701184228/https://deadline.com/2019/05/producer-greg-berlanti-new-series-record-strong-upfront-prodigal-son-katy-keene-batwoman-1202612375/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。除电视外，贝兰提还执导了爱情喜剧电影《[[亲爱的初恋]]》，这也是首部由[[主要电影公司|好莱坞六巨头]]制片公司发行、面向北美主流电影市场的同性恋题材青春爱情片；该片在全球取得了超过6600万美元的票房佳绩<ref name=opening2>{{cite web |url=http://deadline.com/2018/03/tomb-raider-black-panther-i-can-only-imagine-love-simon-weekend-box-office-results-sunday-1202341517/ |title='Black Panther' Keeps B.O. Treasure From 'Tomb Raider'; How 'I Can Only Imagine' Hit A $17M High Note |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |publisher=Penske Business Media |date=2018-03-18 |first=Anthony |last=D'Alessandro |accessdate=2018-03-18 |archive-date=2018-03-20 |archive-url=https://www.webcitation.org/6y38PDcrh?url=http://deadline.com/2018/03/tomb-raider-black-panther-i-can-only-imagine-love-simon-weekend-box-office-results-sunday-1202341517/ |dead-url=no }}</ref><ref name="BOM">{{cite web |url=http://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=pan.htm |title=Pan (2015) |website=Box Office Mojo |accessdate=2016-02-29 |archive-date=2019-07-12 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190712022448/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/movies/?id=pan.htm |dead-url=no }}</ref>。

== 早期生活 ==
葛瑞格·贝兰提出生于[[纽约州]][[拉伊市 (纽约州)|拉伊市]]。他出生在一个有[[意大利]]血统的[[华斯普]]（WASP，意译为[[白人盎格鲁-撒克逊新教徒]]，是今天构成美国[[上流社会]]的绝大部分）家庭。贝兰提于1994年毕业于[[西北大学 (伊利诺伊州)|西北大学]]<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.communication.northwestern.edu/news/press_release.php?itemID=285 |title=NORTHWESTERN ALUMNI TAKE HOME EMMY AWARDS |date=2013-09-24 |publisher=Northwestern School of Communication |accessdate=2014-08-23 |archive-date=2014-02-06 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140206010006/https://www.communication.northwestern.edu/news/press_release.php?itemID=285 |dead-url=yes }}</ref>。

== 个人生活 ==
自2013年中期以来，贝兰提就持续与[[洛杉矶银河]]的职业足球运动员[[罗比·罗渣士]]交往<ref name="Backlot1">{{cite web|url=http://www.thebacklot.com/greg-berlanti-interview-the-flash-dating-robbie-rogers/08/2014/|title=Greg Berlanti Talks "The Flash" Excitement & Loving Robbie Rogers|first=Jim|last=Halterman|work=The Backlot|date=2014-08-19|accessdate=2014-09-06|archive-date=2015-06-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150608185138/http://www.thebacklot.com/greg-berlanti-interview-the-flash-dating-robbie-rogers/08/2014/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name="Robbie1">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/BBxoAI9p3Y_/|title=robbierogersHappy Valentines Day!!! Thank you to all the men and women who made it possible for me to be able to share my life with the man I love. xRR @gberlanti|work=[[Instagram]]|date=2016-02-14|accessdate=2016-02-14|first=Robbie|last=Rogers|archive-date=2016-02-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160222134033/https://www.instagram.com/p/BBxoAI9p3Y_/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2016年2月18日，两人透过[[代孕]]的方式获得了他们的第一个儿子凯莱布·贝兰提（Caleb Berlanti）<ref name="Caleb1">{{cite web|url=http://celebritybabies.people.com/2016/02/20/greg-berlanti-welcomes-a-son-via-surrogate/|title=Greg Berlanti Welcomes a Son via Surrogate: 'My Heart Is Full Forever'|work=[[人物 (美国杂志)|People]]|date=2016-02-20|accessdate=2016-02-20|archive-date=2016-06-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160622183754/http://celebritybabies.people.com/2016/02/20/greg-berlanti-welcomes-a-son-via-surrogate/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。 2016年12月31日，贝兰提与罗渣士宣布他们已完成订婚<ref>{{Cite news|url=http://www.eonline.com/news/818972/robbie-rogers-and-greg-berlanti-are-engaged|title=Robbie Rogers and Greg Berlanti Are Engaged|newspaper=E! Online|language=en-US|access-date=2017-01-01|archive-date=2017-01-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170101091623/http://www.eonline.com/news/818972/robbie-rogers-and-greg-berlanti-are-engaged|dead-url=no}}</ref>。两人的婚礼于2017年12月2日举行<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.etonline.com/arrow-flash-producer-greg-berlanti-marries-soccer-star-robbie-rogers-see-their-sweet-wedding-pics|title='Arrow,' 'Flash' Producer Greg Berlanti Marries Soccer Star Robbie Rogers -- See Their Sweet Wedding Pics!|publisher=ETOnline|access-date=2019-06-14|archive-date=2017-12-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171208174842/http://www.etonline.com/arrow-flash-producer-greg-berlanti-marries-soccer-star-robbie-rogers-see-their-sweet-wedding-pics|dead-url=no}}</ref>。2019年5月13日，贝兰提与罗渣士获得了他们的女儿米雅·芭芭拉·罗渣士-贝兰提（Mia Barbara Rogers-Berlanti）<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/BxfdiU6noNz/|title=Greg Berlanti on Instagram: “Welcome to the world Mia Barbara Rogers-Berlanti. 5/13/19. Our hearts and our family have grown even larger. @robbierogers has already…”|website=Instagram|access-date=2019-05-26|language=en|archive-date=2019-06-12|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190612214107/https://www.instagram.com/p/BxfdiU6noNz/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

