'''戴米恩·李昂尼'''（{{langx|en|Damien Leone}}，{{bd|1982年|1月29日}}），[[美国]][[电影导演]]、[[编剧]]和[[电影制片人|制片人]]，以编剧和导演《{{le|骇灵夜|All Hallows' Eve (2013 film)}}》、《[[刽乐小丑]]》及其续集而闻名，每部电影都以他的原创角色——[[小丑亚特]]为主角。

==职业生涯==
2016年，《[[刽乐小丑]]》上映。该片由李昂尼编剧并执导，最终成为一部[[邪典电影]]，并让他获得了[[疯哥利牙链锯奖]]最佳限量发行影片及最佳特效化妆提名<ref name=FCA19>{{cite web|url=https://www.dreadcentral.com/news/288143/fangoria-resurrects-the-chainsaw-awards-and-dread-central-presents-terrifier-snagged-three-nominations/|title=Fangoria Resurrects the Chainsaw Awards and Dread Central Presents' TERRIFIER Snagged Three Nominations!|website={{le|恐惧中心|Dread Central}}|first=Jonathan|last=Barkan|date=2019-01-22|access-date=2023-04-18|archive-date=2024-09-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240925213054/https://www.dreadcentral.com/news/288143/fangoria-resurrects-the-chainsaw-awards-and-dread-central-presents-terrifier-snagged-three-nominations/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/news/3729361/terrifier-original-cult-classic-slasher-is-now-streaming-on-screambox/|title='Terrifier' – Original Cult Classic Slasher Is Now Streaming on SCREAMBOX!|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=Brad|last=Miska|date=2022-09-01|access-date=2023-04-18|archive-date=2022-11-08|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221108080222/https://bloody-disgusting.com/news/3729361/terrifier-original-cult-classic-slasher-is-now-streaming-on-screambox/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。
2022年，同样由李昂尼编导的续集《[[刽乐小丑2]]》上映后获得了影评界的好评，并在票房上取得成功，以仅25万美元的预算创下超过1500万美元的票房<ref>{{cite web|url=https://collider.com/terrifier-2-extended-theatrical-run/|title=Fan Demand Brings Brutal Slasher 'Terrifier 2' Back to Theaters This Weekend|website=www.collider.com|date=2022-10-13|access-date=2022-10-18|archive-date=2022-11-17|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20221117042134/https://collider.com/terrifier-2-extended-theatrical-run/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt10403420/|title=Terrifier 2|website=[[Box Office Mojo]]|access-date=2023-04-18|archive-date=2023-11-14|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231114012010/https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt10403420/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。李昂尼凭借《刽乐小丑2》再次获得了疯哥利牙链锯奖最佳限量发行影片及最佳化妆效果提名，并最终获得该奖项<ref name="FCA23">{{cite web|url=https://www.chainsawawards.org/winners/|title=Winners - Fangoria Chainsaw Awards|website=[[疯哥利牙链锯奖]]|date=2023-05-22|access-date=2023-05-22|archive-date=2023-05-22|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230522025244/https://www.chainsawawards.org/winners/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

随后，李昂尼宣布他正在筹备《[[刽乐小丑3]]》<ref name=T31>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/interviews/3554905/interview-david-howard-thornton-teases-terrifier-2-says-script-terrifier-3-already-underway/|title=[Interview] David Howard Thornton Teases 'Terrifier 2' and Says Script for 'Terrifier 3' is Already Underway|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=Cullen|last=Fleetwood|date=2019-04-09|access-date=2023-04-16|archive-date=2023-03-20|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230320204308/https://bloody-disgusting.com/interviews/3554905/interview-david-howard-thornton-teases-terrifier-2-says-script-terrifier-3-already-underway/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref name=T32>{{cite web|url=https://www.insider.com/damien-leone-terrifier-3-evil-dead-sam-raimi-new-project-2023-2|title='Terrifier' director Damien Leone teases 'Terrifier 3' and a potential 4th film, and says he's met with 'Evil Dead' director Sam Raimi about a new project|website=[[内幕公司]]|first=Eammon|last=Jacobs|date=2023-02-02|access-date=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-09-01|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230901014602/https://www.insider.com/damien-leone-terrifier-3-evil-dead-sam-raimi-new-project-2023-2|dead-url=no}}</ref>以及即将上映的电影《{{le|夺命假期|Stream (Film)}}》<ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3742528/stream-guitarist-paul-wiley-to-score-new-horror-movie-from-the-producers-of-terrifier-exclusive/|title='Stream' – Guitarist Paul Wiley to Score New Horror Movie from the Producers of 'Terrifier'! [Exclusive]|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=Brad|last=Miska|date=2022-12-05|access-date=2023-04-14|archive-date=2023-03-29|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230329115117/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3742528/stream-guitarist-paul-wiley-to-score-new-horror-movie-from-the-producers-of-terrifier-exclusive/|dead-url=no}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3764501/stream-poster-puts-skin-in-the-game/|title='Stream' Poster Puts Skin In the Game!|website={{le|Bloody Disgusting}}|first=Brad|last=Miska|date=2023-06-02|access-date=2023-06-02|archive-date=2024-09-25|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240925223230/https://bloody-disgusting.com/movie/3764501/stream-poster-puts-skin-in-the-game/|dead-url=no}}</ref>。

